l":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/helmutamua","id":226952690,"login":"helmutamua","node_id":"U_kgDODYcF8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-core/commits/fee5c99690f2ac1707ce713e92bc37ca9bf005da/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-27T14:57:34Z","email":"helmut@amua.app","name":"Helmut Lindel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-27T14:57:34Z","email":"helmut@amua.app","name":"Helmut Lindel"},"message":"Add debug logging and initialization script for window.remoteApp_core\n\nAdded comprehensive debugging to diagnose why window.remoteApp_core\nis not being exposed when remoteEntry.js loads.\n\nChanges:\n1. Added console.log in bootstrap.tsx when window.remoteApp_core is set\n2. Created public/init-remote.js initialization script\n3. Added expose-global.ts entry point (alternative approach)\n\nThe issue is that Module Federation''s remoteEntry.js doesn''t automatically\nexecute exposed modules - they must be explicitly imported. The shell needs\nto either:\n- Import ''remoteApp_core/bootstrap'' after loading remoteEntry.js\n- Load the init-remote.js script after remoteEntry.js\n\nDebug logs will show:\n- When bootstrap module loads\n- When window.remoteApp_core is set\n- Contract version and available functions","tree":{"sha":"387b2c8204645de0949db7fcceaac3e7f5a94bf1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-core/git/trees/387b2c8204645de0949db7fcceaac3e7f5a94bf1"},"url"