repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-core/commits/a169fccb7ae3ab1b5bcdbba0131992e98d6b5721/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-27T10:30:39Z","email":"helmut@amua.app","name":"Helmut Lindel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-27T10:30:39Z","email":"helmut@amua.app","name":"Helmut Lindel"},"message":"Add GitHub Actions CI/CD pipelines with blue/green deployment\n\nPrompt 11: Copy and adapt pipelines from shell\n- Copied ci.yml and deploy.yml from react-app-shell\n- Updated workflow names to identify react-app-core\n- Updated PROJECT_NAME to react-app-core for infrastructure tags\n\nCI Workflow (ci.yml):\n- Runs on pull requests to develop, release, main\n- Test & quality checks (typecheck, lint, format, unit, integration)\n- CodeQL security scan\n- Dependency vulnerability check\n- Does NOT deploy\n\nDeploy Workflow (deploy.yml):\n- 4-stage pipeline: Test → Build → Deploy GREEN → Verify+Switch\n- Triggers: push to develop/release/main, manual dispatch\n- Manual dispatch supports environment and cloud selection\n- Cloud auto-detection: azure (implemented), aws (fails with clear error)\n\nStage 1 - Test:\n- Typecheck, lint, format check\n- Unit tests with coverage (70% threshold)\n- Integration tests\n- CodeQL security scan\n- npm audit\n\nStage 2 - Build:\n- Build container image\n- Push to GHCR (ghcr.io/amuaapps/react-app-core)\n- Tag with environment and SHA\n\nStage 3 - Deploy GREEN:\n- Deploy to Azure Container Apps with 0% traffic\n- Outputs: green_url, green_id, blue_id, active_url\n- Upload deploy-outputs artifact\n\nStage 4 - Verify & Switch:\n- Download deploy-outputs artifact\n- IaC security checks (checkov on Bicep)\n- Health check: GET /health returns 200\n- Smoke tests:\n  - Verify HTML content and React root\n  - Verify GET /assets/remoteEntry.js returns 200\n  - Verify remoteEntry.js contains remoteApp_core global\n- Switch traffic to GREEN (100%)\n- Rollback to BLUE on failure\n\nRollback behavior:\n- If Stage 4 fails, traffic remains on BLUE\n- Pipeline fails with clear error\n- GREEN revision available at 0% for debugging","tree":{"sha":"4d9137a9f5e48c44af84b2d986795e593c6f44d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-core/git/trees/4d9137a9f5e48c44af84b2d986795e593c6f44d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-core/git/commits/a169fccb7ae3ab1b5bcdbba0131992e98d6b5721","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226952690?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/helmutamua","id":226952690,"login":"helmutamua","node_id":"U_kgDODYcF8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amuaapps/react-app-core/commit/a169fccb7ae3ab1b5bcdbba0131992e98d6b5721","node_id":"C_kwDORCNJZNoAKGExNjlmY2NiN2FlM2FiMWI1YmNkYmJhMDEzMTk5MmU5OGQ2YjU3MjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amuaapps/react-app-core