e-specific defaults\n- Updated README.md and DEPLOYMENT.md references\n\nNginx configuration updates:\n- Cache hashed assets in /assets/* with 1-year immutable cache\n- DO NOT cache /assets/remoteEntry.js (no-cache for shell)\n- Keep /health endpoint returning 200\n- Maintain security headers and gzip compression\n\nInfrastructure features:\n- Container Apps Environment + Container App deployment\n- Blue/green revision support with traffic splitting\n- OIDC authentication for GitHub Actions\n- Supports 0% traffic for new revisions (safe deployment)\n- Health check endpoint at /health\n\nCreated placeholder infra/aws/README.md for future AWS support","tree":{"sha":"d8e16198d5ecf670d3a520430a857810772d36f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-core/git/trees/d8e16198d5ecf670d3a520430a857810772d36f9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-core/git/commits/bb86d22abecbb39bcabf7c48d62f52c0fe004661","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226952690?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/helmutamua","id":226952690,"login":"helmutamua","node_id":"U_kgDODYcF8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua","user_view_type