me CSS\n\nPrompt 8: Theme and UI library usage\n- Remove globals.css import from bootstrap.tsx (shell provides tokens)\n- Create standalone.tsx entry that imports globals.css for local dev\n- Update index.html to use standalone.tsx instead of bootstrap.tsx\n- Verified no hardcoded colors/spacing/typography in components\n- All components use token-based Tailwind classes (bg-background, text-foreground, etc.)\n- PlaceholderPage renders only body content (no shell chrome)\n\nTheme loading strategy:\n- Shell environment: Shell loads theme globally, core uses those tokens\n- Standalone dev: standalone.tsx loads globals.css for local testing\n- Remote entry: bootstrap.tsx has NO theme import (prevents duplication)\n\nDocumentation:\n- Created docs/theme-strategy.md with full theme architecture\n- Updated README with theme strategy overview\n- Documented token compliance rules and forbidden patterns","tree":{"sha":"df6162e04e8caac2fa7e5a4d2f5859d4803f2e5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-core/git/trees/df6162e04e8caac2fa7e5a4d2f5859d4803f2e5e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-core/git/commits/f60440c890227d4647dabb2195636efe4f762591","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226952690?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/helmutamua","id":226952690,"login":"helmutamua","node_id":"U_kgDODYcF8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/repos","