izations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Forsakringskassan/rimfrost-portal-bff/commits/249e9abcbe126604d8b7407b1235427b34d99798/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T05:24:55Z","email":"lisa.wedin@ductus.se","name":"LisaWedin_Ductus"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T05:24:55Z","email":"lisa.wedin@ductus.se","name":"LisaWedin_Ductus"},"message":"fix: remove dead TasksRequest.varde field entirely\n\nmvn verify failed: SpotBugs flags varde as\nUUF_UNUSED_PUBLIC_OR_PROTECTED_FIELD, correctly — it''s never read\nanywhere, only ever written to by Jackson deserialization. Rather than\nsuppress the warning, removed the field outright, which is the cleaner of\nthe two remedies teknisk-spec.md already suggested for this.\n\nVerified existing clients that still send \"varde\" in the request body\naren''t affected: Quarkus''s default Jackson config ignores unknown JSON\nproperties, and the tests that still send it in their request bodies\ncontinue to pass unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"d4bc8b794deeee980cbd86cec46226de62b4c4d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Forsakringskassan/rimfrost-portal-bff/git/trees/d4bc8b794deeee980cbd86cec46226de62b4c4d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Forsakringskassan/rimfrost-portal-bff/git/commits/249e9abcbe126604d8b7407b1235427b34d99798","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/242170731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LisaWedin-Ductus","id":242170731,"login":"LisaWedin-Ductus","node_id":"U_kgDODm87aw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Forsakringskassan/rimfrost-portal-bff/commit/249e9abcbe126604d8b7407b1235427b34d99798","node_id":"C_kwDORCTAD9oAKDI0OWU5YWJjYmUxMjY2MDRkOGI3NDA3YjEyMzU0MjdiMzRkOTk3OTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Forsakringskassan/rimfrost-portal-bff/commit/b088de536a00871922ce2a35f2ec2b970124ea65","sha":"b088de536a00871922ce2a35f2ec2b970124ea65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Forsakringskassan/rimfrost-portal-bff/commits/b088de536a00871922ce2a35f2ec2b970124ea65"}],"sha":"249e9abcbe126604d8b7407b1235427b34d99798","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Forsakringskassan/rimfrost-portal-bff/commits/249e9abcbe126604d8b7407b1235427b34d99798"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/242170731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LisaWedin-Ductus","id":242170731,"login":"LisaWedin-Ductus","node_id":"U_kgDODm87aw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Forsakringskassan/rimfrost-portal-bff/commits/b088de536a00871922ce2a35f2ec2b970124ea65/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T11:04:44Z","email":"lisa.wedin@ductus.se","name":"LisaWedin_Ductus"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T11:04:44Z","email":"lisa.wedin@ductus.se","name":"LisaWedin_Ductus"},"message":"fix: stop leaking upstream error bodies, clarify unverified typId\n\nCode review findings on the current branch (all pre-existing, not from the\nborttagna_pga_behorighet passthrough):\n\n- The four OUL-calling endpoints no longer put OUL''s raw error response\n  body under an \"upstream\" key in the client-facing JSON error payload.\n  It''s still logged server-side (that''s the whole point of capturing it),\n  just no longer sent to the browser — OUL error text could contain\n  internal details that have no business reaching an end user.\n- Removed a leftover debug log on POST /tasks that dumped whether an\n  Authorization header was present and its length, present only on that\n  one endpoint and serving no purpose beyond what an actual auth failure\n  already surfaces.\n- Since the auth-header migration, typId is never used to select whose\n  data OUL returns — only the Authorization header does — so it no longer\n  has real security meaning, yet was logged/MDC''d as if it identified the\n  caller. Renamed to clientTypId and explicitly logged as \"(unverified)\"\n  everywhere it appears, so it can''t be mistaken for a verified identity\n  in an incident/audit trail.\n- varde is no longer read anywhere; dropped its @NotBlank requirement\n  instead of forcing clients to keep sending a meaningless placeholder.\n  Resolves the matching entry in teknisk-spec.md''s known-limitations\n  table, replaced with a note describing the actual current state.\n- Added the first test coverage for POST /tasks/{uppgiftId}/reassign\n  (success and upstream-error cases) — it previously had none.","tree":{"sha":"8f375e8b6925a618d4956c89e448f499c654679a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Forsakringskassan/rimfrost-portal-bff/git/trees/8f375e8b6925a618d4956c89e448f499c654679a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Forsakringskassan/rimfrost-portal-bff/git/commits/b088de536a00871922ce2a35f2ec2b970124ea65","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/242170731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LisaWedin-Ductus","id":242170731,"login":"LisaWedin-Ductus","node_id":"U_kgDODm87aw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/