-01T07:09:17Z","email":"lisa.wedin@ductus.se","name":"LisaWedin_Ductus"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T07:09:17Z","email":"lisa.wedin@ductus.se","name":"LisaWedin_Ductus"},"message":"feat: forward borttagna_pga_behorighet from OUL unchanged\n\nFKPOC-944 (F1+F2). RawTaskBackendResponse and TasksResponse both gain the\nnew field, passed straight through in getTasks and getTeamTasks with no\ninterpretation — the BFF makes no SID/behörighet judgement of its own, all\nof that logic stays in OUL.\n\nAlso adds the first test coverage for GET /tasks/team, which previously\nhad none.\n\ndocs/krav.md (PBFF-FR-03.6) and docs/teknisk-spec.md document the\npassthrough and are explicit that the BFF does no SID assessment itself.","tree":{"sha":"d6d523ec3196f428c6db094325c8d93fd58c7566","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Forsakringskassan/rimfrost-portal-bff/git/trees/d6d523ec3196f428c6db094325c8d93fd58c7566"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Forsakringskassan/rimfrost-portal-bff/git/commits/9f1be7fe797db7da6a7f72c14bf156ab6592a9ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/242170731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LisaWedin-Ductus","id":242170731,"login":"LisaWedin-Ductus","node_id":"U_kgDODm87aw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/s