ents{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ryanhelms","id":1596639,"login":"ryanhelms","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1OTY2Mzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Helms-AI/claude-marketplace/commits/8cef3bbe8e6f8fd1abcabd16e16b780468c52a53/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-01T09:48:38Z","email":"ryan@helms.ai","name":"Ryan Helms"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-01T09:48:38Z","email":"ryan@helms.ai","name":"Ryan Helms"},"message":"fix: Complete acceptance criteria for all phases\n\n## Phase 4 (Autonomy)\n- Add check-autonomy.sh script for hook integration\n\n## Phase 5 (Mobile)\n- All 5 agents, 7 skills verified complete\n\n## Phase 6 (MLOps)\n- Add missing agents: monitoring-engineer.md, feature-engineer.md\n- Add capabilities.json for cross-domain routing\n- Now has 5 agents, 7 skills as specified\n\n## Phase 7 (Performance Testing)\n- Add performance-test.md recipe\n- Add load testing capabilities to testing plugin\n\n## Phase 8 (i18n)\n- Add i18n capability to frontend plugin\n- Add localization capability to documentation plugin\n\n## Discovery Index\n- Add 20 new skills to discovery-index.json\n- Add mobile and mlops domains\n- Now covers all 60+ skills with keywords\n\nAll acceptance criteria from Discussion #8 phases now complete.","tree":{"s