r_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1596639?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ryanhelms","id":1596639,"login":"ryanhelms","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1OTY2Mzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Helms-AI/claude-marketplace/commits/8f187276637d7fa8fa40e7251adbe3cffbd303b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-01T09:31:25Z","email":"ryan@helms.ai","name":"Ryan Helms"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-01T09:31:25Z","email":"ryan@helms.ai","name":"Ryan Helms"},"message":"feat: Implement Discussion #7 enhancements - Path to A+ grade\n\n## Implementation Plan from Discussion #8\n\nThis implements all 8 phases from the implementation plan to address\ngaps identified in Discussion #7 (Plugin System Review).\n\n### Phase 1: Plugin Discovery Service\n- New skill: /pm-discover - intent-based skill finder\n- Discovery index with 40+ skills, keywords, use cases\n- Natural language query matching\n\n### Phase 2: 5-Minute Quickstart Tutorial\n- docs/QUICKSTART.md - interactive getting started guide\n- New skill: /pm-tutorial - step-by-step onboarding\n\n### Phase 3: Workflow Recipe Cookbook\n- docs/recipes/ - 10 workflow templates\n- Recipes: full-stack-feature, api-endpoint, react-component,\n  auth-system, cicd-pipeline, database-migration, data-pipeline,\n  security-audit, design-token, api-documentation, i18n-setup\n- New skill: /pm-recipe - execute recipes by name\n\n### Phase 4: Configurable Autonomy Levels\n- .claude/autonomy.json.template - autonomy configuration\n- New skill: /pm-autonomy - view/set autonomy profiles\n- docs/AUTONOMY.md - configuration guide\n- Profiles: supervised, assisted, autonomous\n\n### Phase 5: Mobile Domain Plugin (NEW)\n- 5 agents: mobile-lead, ios-specialist, android-specialist,\n  cross-platform, mobile-qa\n- 7 skills: mobile-orchestrator, mobile-ios-developer,\n  mobile-android-developer, mobile-react-native, mobile-flutter,\n  mobile-testing, mobile-team-session\n- LSP: Swift, Kotlin, Dart, TypeScript\n- Covers iOS, Android, React Native, Flutter\n\n### Phase 6: MLOps Domain Plugin (NEW)\n- 3 agents: mlops-lead, ml-engineer, deployment-specialist\n- 7 skills: mlops-orchestrator, mlops-model-trainer,\n  mlops-model-deployer, mlops-feature-engineer,\n  mlops-experiment-tracker, mlops-monitoring, mlops-team-session\n- Covers PyTorch, TensorFlow, MLflow, Kubeflow\n\n### Phase 7: Performance Testing Enhancement\n- New agent: perf-engineer\n- New skills: testing-load-engineer, testing-performance-analyzer\n- k6, Artillery, Locust, Lighthouse CI support\n\n### Phase 8: i18n/l10n Support\n- New agent: i18n-specialist\n- New skills: frontend-i18n-engineer, docs-localization\n- i18next, react-intl, ICU MessageFormat, RTL support\n\n### Summary\n- Plugins: 11 → 13 (added mobile, mlops)\n- Agents: 58 → 70+\n- Skills: 77 → 95+\n- New PM skills: 4 (discover, tutorial, recipe, autonomy)\n\n### Version Bumps\n- pm: 1.3.0 → 1.4.0\n- frontend: 1.2.0 → 1.3.0\n- testing: 1.1.0 → 1.2.0\n- documentation: 1.1.0 → 1.2.0\n- mobile: NEW 1.0.0\n- mlops: NEW 1.0.0\n\nReferences: Discussion #7, Discussion #8","tree":{"sha":"d63d487efd3e172b29776a3a24eb51c56a61f7f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Helms-AI/claude-marketplace/git/trees