l":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Helms-AI/claude-marketplace/commits/d73edd9a9c7a2e1ff6fa5168161cfc7fb9377ad9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-31T16:11:05Z","email":"ryan@helms.ai","name":"Ryan Helms"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-31T16:11:05Z","email":"ryan@helms.ai","name":"Ryan Helms"},"message":"Implement Lit Web Components architecture foundation (Phase 1)\n\nAdd modular frontend architecture using Lit 3 and Preact Signals:\n\n## Store (Centralized State)\n- app-state.js: Single source of truth using Preact Signals\n  - Global UI state (theme, sidebar, panels)\n  - Connection state management\n  - Navigation/tabs state\n  - Data state (changesets, agents, skills)\n  - Terminal state (messages, streaming)\n  - Token/cost tracking\n  - Computed values for derived state\n  - Actions for state mutations with batching\n\n## Services (Non-UI Logic)\n- sse-service.js: SSE connection with auto-reconnect\n- sdk-client.js: Claude SDK bridge API client\n\n## Core Components\n- icon-button.js: Reusable icon button with variants\n- badge.js: Status badge with multiple variants\n- resizable-panel.js: Resizable panel for sidebar/bottom\n\n## Conversation Components\n- message-bubble.js: Self-contained message display\n- conversation-stream.js: Efficient message list with repeat()\n\n## Indicator Components\n- thinking-indicator.js: Animated thinking states\n- connection-status.js: Connection state display\n\n## Tool Card Components\n- tool-card-base.js: Base class for all tool cards\n- bash-tool-card.js: Bash command display\n- read-tool-card.js: File read display\n\n## Infrastructure\n- Import map in index.html for CDN-based ES modules\n- Legacy bridge for gradual migration\n- Component composition patterns\n\nThis enables true modularization with:\n- Shadow DOM for style encapsulation\n- ES Modules for clean dependencies\n- Fine-grained reactive updates\n- No build step required\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9518c7af91b766e7a1bfc5fc707cebc51f4d8678","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Helms-AI/claude-marketplace/git/trees/9518c7af91b766e7a1bfc5fc707cebc51f4d8678"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Helms-AI/claude-marketplace/git/commits/d73edd9a9c7a2e1ff6fa5168161cfc7fb9377ad9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1596639?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ryanhelms","id":1596639,"login":"ryanhelms","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1OTY2Mzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Helms-AI/claude-marketplace/commit/d73edd9a9c7a2e1ff6fa5168161cfc7fb9377ad9","node_id":"C_kwDORCe4y9oAKGQ3M2VkZDlhOWM3YTJlMWZmNmZhNTE2ODE2MWNmYzdmYjkzNzdhZDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Helms-AI/claude-marketplace/commit/47e482ffddb4f226a4cacb7cdad5d86808bbf6e3","sha":"47e482ffddb4