ager and TranscriptWatcher\n- Reduce poll interval from 1.0s to 0.5s for faster updates\n- Add proper response headers to disable buffering (no-store, Pragma)\n- Add /api/debug/sse-status endpoint for troubleshooting\n- Enable debug mode via DASHBOARD_DEBUG=1 environment variable\n- Improve watch endpoint with better error logging\n- Update dashboard version to 1.5.1\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5a0da543fd632c5eb5f148a7bbde2b0665617f60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Helms-AI/claude-marketplace/git/trees/5a0da543fd632c5eb5f148a7bbde2b0665617f60"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Helms-AI/claude-marketplace/git/commits/c9004bc2d860ba96f1cf4f25c6f6455000751d56","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1596639?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ryanhelms","id":1596639,"login":"ryanhelms","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1OTY2Mzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Helms-AI/claude-marketplace/commit/c9004bc2d860ba96f1cf4f25c6f6455000751d56","node_id":"C_kwDORCe4y9oAKGM5MDA0YmMyZDg2MGJhOTZmMWNmNGYyNWM2ZjY0NTUwMDA3NTFkNTY","parents":[{"html_url":"ht