om/ryanhelms","id":1596639,"login":"ryanhelms","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1OTY2Mzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Helms-AI/claude-marketplace/commits/2b48328382630218bd79e7aefab755dc1a8f8bb4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-29T22:49:20Z","email":"ryan@helms.ai","name":"Ryan Helms"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-29T22:49:20Z","email":"ryan@helms.ai","name":"Ryan Helms"},"message":"Replace ux plugin with user-experience and frontend plugins\n\nSplit the monolithic ux plugin into two specialized domains:\n- user-experience: Design thinking, ideation, aesthetic direction (pre-code)\n- frontend: Component implementation, engineering, quality (code phase)\n\nAdded 8 new domain plugins with cross-domain orchestration:\n- pm: Project manager broker for workflow coordination\n- architecture: System design, patterns, ADRs\n- backend: APIs, databases, services\n- testing: Test strategy, unit/integration/E2E\n- devops: CI/CD, infrastructure, monitoring\n- data: Data modeling, pipelines, analytics\n- security: Audits, threat modeling, compliance\n- documentation: API docs, guides, runbooks\n\nUpdated all domain references from \"ux\" to \"user-experience\"/\"frontend\"\nin PM, backend, and testing plugin capabilities.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2b4d2c82f933eed803b8c336a1b9c8cf96f9c5a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Helms-AI/claude-marketplace/git/trees/2b4d2c82f933eed803b8c336a1b9c8cf96f9c5a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/