"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanhelms","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Helms-AI/claude-marketplace/commits/358b97dd901574684981a40e8545aff11241a2a0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-27T23:27:25Z","email":"ryan@helms.ai","name":"Ryan Helms"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-27T23:27:25Z","email":"ryan@helms.ai","name":"Ryan Helms"},"message":"Add aesthetic-first UX plugin v3.0.0 with 18 skills and 10 agents\n\nTransform UX plugin from technically competent but aesthetically neutral\ninto a design-quality-focused system that produces distinctive interfaces.\n\nNew skills (6):\n- ux-aesthetic-director: Design thinking layer for aesthetic direction\n- ux-typography-curator: Character-rich font selection and pairing\n- ux-color-alchemist: OKLCH-native mood-driven color systems\n- ux-layout-composer: Grid-breaking spatial composition\n- ux-texture-atmosphere: Grain, gradients, glassmorphism, shadows\n- ux-micro-delight: Cursors, hovers, loading states, celebrations\n\nNew agents (2):\n- Quinn Martinez: Aesthetic Director & Brand Strategist\n- Avery Nakamura: Typography Specialist\n\nEnhanced skills (4):\n- ux-orchestrator: Aesthetic-first workflow routing\n- ux-design-system: Anti-generic guidelines, personality tokens\n- ux-component-architect: Distinctive patterns, shadcn customization\n- ux-motion-designer: Motion personality profiles, page load orchestration\n\nUpdated agents (3):\n- Jordan Chen: Team coordination with Quinn/Avery integration\n- Sam Rivera: Aesthetic personality token layer\n- Jordan Park: Motion personality framework\n\nKey philosophy: Every interface should have a point of view. Fight against\ngeneric SaaS templates, AI purple gradients, and forgettable designs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ac3a7535f5abcf19271da1f41273a5542ac1d838","url":"https://api.github.com/re