 guide\n\nUsers with existing VPC, ECS, and RDS can skip Step 1 and provide\ntheir own resource IDs in terraform.tfvars.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"29b84979f65d72317eb554dd926b9cd16a98ecc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/trees/29b84979f65d72317eb554dd926b9cd16a98ecc0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/commits/7003817c1df78b4e6da28b5e6a859806f8e4f551","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/7003817c1df78b4e6da28b5e6a859806f8e4f551","node_id":"C_kwDORCjIEtoAKDcwMDM4MTdjMWRmNzhiNGU2ZGEyOGI1ZTZhODU5ODA2ZjhlNGY1NTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/2c3963800f46c0b2855d86f08fdceca6281a7ec0","sha":"2c3963800f46c0b2855d86f08fdceca6281a7ec0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/2c3963800f46c0b2855d86f08fdceca6281a7ec0"}],"sha":"7003817c1df78b4e6da28b5e6a859806f8e4f551","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/7003817c1df78b4e6da28b5e6a859806f8e4f551"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/2c3963800f46c0b2855d86f08fdceca6281a7ec0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-11T21:52:45Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-11T21:52:45Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Consolidate deployment docs into README, delete redundant files\n\nMerge verified unique content from DEPLOYMENT.md and\nINFRASTRUCTURE_ONBOARDING.md into the README: CI/CD setup with\nactual GitHub secrets (individual TF_VAR_* not TERRAFORM_TFVARS),\nbuild & deploy instructions, secrets & credentials inventory,\nsecrets flow diagram, dev vs production comparison, security notes,\nand troubleshooting. Verified all claims against actual terraform\nconfigs and workflow files before merging. Dropped inaccurate\ncontent (use_shared_infra toggle, db_instance_class variable,\nContainer Insights claim, standalone mode).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f30f8003e783d29cd484f4ebc93dd3f0d8bd7c07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/trees/f30f8003e783d29cd484f4ebc93dd3f0d8bd7c07"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/commits/2c3963800f46c0b2855d86f08fdceca6281a7ec0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/2c3963800f46c0b2855d86f08fdceca6281a7ec0","node_id":"C_kwDORCjIEtoAKDJjMzk2MzgwMGY0NmMwYjI4NTVkODZmMDhmZGNlY2E2MjgxYTdlYzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/2ca0254f38afee98178c28de3449db057d108bc6","sha":"2ca0254f38afee98178c28de3449db057d108bc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/2ca0254f38afee98178c28de3449db057d108bc6"}],"sha":"2c3963800f46c0b2855d86f08fdceca6281a7ec0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/2c3963800f46c0b2855d86f08fdceca6281a7ec0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/2ca0254f38afee98178c28de3449db057d108bc6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-11T21:43:30Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-11T21:43:30Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Fix architecture diagram and remove redundant overview section\n\nRewrite system diagram to show the integration platform as a separate\nmicroservice, not embedded inside \"Your Application.\" The correct flow\nis: Your App embeds the MFE → MFE calls Integration Platform backend\n→ backend syncs with external systems (QBO, Xero). Remove the\nredundant Architecture Overview section from the README (the layer\ndiagram duplicated what''s already in SYNC_ARCHITECTURE.md). Strip\nversion vector details from the diagram — that detail belongs in\nthe dedicated Version Vectors section.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b90025e0e99908e1f2bd5d0b7253ca168421caae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/trees/b90025e0e99908e1f2bd5d0b7253ca168421caae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/commits/2ca0254f38afee98178c28de3449db057d108bc6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/2ca0254f38afee98178c28de3449db057d108bc6","node_id":"C_kwDORCjIEtoAKDJjYTAyNTRmMzhhZmVlOTgxNzhjMjhkZTM0NDlkYjA1N2QxMDhiYzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/cedded8e610c755ab69d6c8a91cfcadf7ee748bd","sha":"cedded8e610c755ab69d6c8a91cfcadf7ee748bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/cedded8e610c755ab69d6c8a91cfcadf7ee748bd"}],"sha":"2ca0254f38afee98178c28de3449db057d108bc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/2ca0254f38afee98178c28de3449db057d108bc6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/cedded8e610c755ab69d6c8a91cfcadf7ee748bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-11T21:36:06Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-11T21:36:06Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Add credential encryption setup details and multi-cloud discla