 and tear-down references\nthat pointed to it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e15aad814d8991aafa702614ab920c9f61f300f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/trees/e15aad814d8991aafa702614ab920c9f61f300f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/commits/7671b093daae230ec5aed0a06d619d33a0313c51","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/7671b093daae230ec5aed0a06d619d33a0313c51","node_id":"C_kwDORCjIEtoAKDc2NzFiMDkzZGFhZTIzMGVjNWFlZDBhMDZkNjE5ZDMzYTAzMTNjNTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/553df677231be1f318e8ef9b6a7ea07279f337fa","sha":"553df677231be1f318e8ef9b6a7ea07279f337fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/553df677231be1f318e8ef9b6a7ea07279f337fa"}],"sha":"7671b093daae230ec5aed0a06d619d33a0313c51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/7671b093daae230ec5aed0a06d619d33a0313c51"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/553df677231be1f318e8ef9b6a7ea07279f337fa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-11T18:50:11Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-11T18:50:11Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Clarify shared-infra output → tfvars variable mapping in deployment guide\n\nThe \"note the outputs\" step didn''t make it clear that shared-infrastructure\noutputs (e.g., vpc_id) map to shared_* prefixed variables in the app''s\nterraform.tfvars. Add an explicit mapping table between the two.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2e936bb84fc4d738005a64b2f8ebaeec7ad5667a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/trees/2e936bb84fc4d738005a64b2f8ebaeec7ad5667a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/commits/553df677231be1f318e8ef9b6a7ea07279f337fa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/553df677231be1f318e8ef9b6a7ea07279f337fa","node_id":"C_kwDORCjIEtoAKDU1M2RmNjc3MjMxYmUxZjMxOGU4ZWY5YjZhN2VhMDcyNzlmMzM3ZmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/fdfddcd9edfb3acb748e28d5ae4ff1dacc078569","sha":"fdfddcd9edfb3acb748e28d5ae4ff1dacc078569","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/fdfddcd9edfb3acb748e28d5ae4ff1dacc078569"}],"sha":"553df677231be1f318e8ef9b6a7ea07279f337fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/553df677231be1f318e8ef9b6a7ea07279f337fa"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/fdfddcd9edfb3acb748e28d5ae4ff1dacc078569/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-11T18:38:03Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-11T18:38:03Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Restructure README with deployment and customization guides\n\nReorganize the README to flow: overview → deploy → customize → dev reference.\n\nNew sections:\n- Architecture Overview: layer diagram, key tables, sync flow summary\n- Deployment Guide: 5-step walkthrough (shared-infra → deploy → secrets → seed → verify)\n- Customization Guide: replace internal_repo.py, enable JWT auth, add integrations\n\nMove detailed sync architecture (version vectors, conflict resolution, change\ndetection modes) to docs/SYNC_ARCHITECTURE.md to keep README scannable.\n\nCondense API Reference from verbose curl examples to endpoint summary table\n(link to /docs for interactive documentation). Fold Security and Environment\nVariables sections into the new Deployment and Customization guides.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5469050c091f7a35a667bd36e142b8d282635f08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/trees/5469050c091f7a35a667bd36e142b8d282635f08"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/commits/fdfddcd9edfb3acb748e28d5ae4ff1dacc078569","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/fdfddcd9edfb3acb748e28d5ae4ff1dacc078569","node_id":"C_kwDORCjIEtoAKGZkZmRkY2Q5ZWRmYjNhY2I3NDhlMjhkNWFlNGZmMWRhY2MwNzg1Njk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/666f71990aba4ac614011171761bc055e9fc8df4","sha":"666f71990aba4ac614011171761bc055e9fc8df4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/666f71990aba4ac614011171761bc055e9fc8df4"}],"sha":"fdfddcd9edfb3acb748e28d5ae4ff1dacc078569","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/fdfddcd9edfb3acb748e28d5ae4ff1dacc078569"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/666f71990aba4ac614011171761bc055e9fc8df4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-10T22:55:56Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-10T22:55:56Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Add GCP and Azure Terraform configurations\n\nAdd GCP config: Cloud Run v2, Artifact Registry, Pub/Sub (with DLQ),\nCloud KMS, Secret Manager secrets, service account with IAM bindings.\n\nAdd Azure config: Container Apps, ACR, Storage Queues (with DLQ),\nKey Vault key + secrets, managed identity with RBAC.\n\nBoth configs wire all environment variables to match config.py\n(CLOUD_PROVIDER, QUEUE_URL, KMS_KEY_ID, DATABASE_URL, etc.) so\nno application code changes are needed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a84a95ac9b60e0211e19b1e46e0f69dff8bd8ede","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/trees/a84a95ac9b60e0211e19b1e46e0f69dff8bd8ede"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/commits/666f71990aba4ac614011171761bc055e9fc8df4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/666f71990aba4ac614011171761bc055e9fc8df4","node_id":"C_kwDORCjIEtoAKDY2NmY3MTk5MGFiYTRhYzYxNDAxMTE3MTc2MWJjMDU1ZTlmYzhkZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/4878b04cf658918fdf9fa6ae3d3c82c728508177","sha":"4878b04cf658918fdf9fa6ae3d3c82c728508177","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/4878b04cf658918fdf9fa6ae3d3c82c728508177"}],"sha":"666f71990aba4ac614011171761bc055e9fc8df4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/666f71990aba4ac614011171761bc055e9fc8df4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/4878b04cf658918fdf9fa6ae3d3c82c728508177/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-10T17:52:04Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-10T17:52:04Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Remove MIT license section from README\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"963956f7912a03a25079e85308820a030ebafb73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/trees/963956f7912a03a25079e85308820a030ebafb73"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/commits/4878b04cf658918fdf9fa6ae3d3c82c728508177","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/4878b04cf658918fdf9fa6ae3d3c82c728508177","node_id":"C_kwDORCjIEtoAKDQ4NzhiMDRjZjY1ODkxOGZkZjlmYTZhZTNkM2M4MmM3Mjg1MDgxNzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/3a0fb5bb703a01a147697cae69900414245850ac","sha":"3a0fb5bb703a01a147697cae69900414245850ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/3a0fb5bb703a01a147697cae69900414245850ac"}],"sha":"4878b04cf658918fdf9fa6ae3d3c82c728508177","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/4878b04cf658918fdf9fa6ae3d3c82c728508177"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/3a0fb5bb703a01a147697cae69900414245850ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-10T17:33:19Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-10T17:33:19Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Prepare repo for public release\n\n- Remove internal docs (CODE_REVIEW_FINDINGS, ADAPTER_SEPARATION_PLAN) from tracking\n- Add internal docs to .gitignore to prevent re-addition\n- Self-contained docker-compose with its own Postgres (no shared DB dependency)\n- Use shared RDS master credentials instead of per-app random password\n- Remove DATABASE_PASSWORD secret requirement from CI/CD deploy\n- Drop unused hashicorp/random provider\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"354f8ec70355cd83f99591d8b94f40899edbed78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/trees/354f8ec70355cd83f99591d8b94f40899edbed78"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/commits/3a0fb5bb703a01a147697cae69900414245850ac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/3a0fb5bb703a01a147697cae69900414245850ac","node_id":"C_kwDORCjIEtoAKDNhMGZiNWJiNzAzYTAxYTE0NzY5N2NhZTY5OTAwNDE0MjQ1ODUwYWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/cdb6a48a74b7b80e1bffebce6d9141ef55d18b96","sha":"cdb6a48a74b7b80e1bffebce6d9141ef55d18b96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/cdb6a48a74b7b80e1bffebce6d9141ef55d18b96"}],"sha":"3a0fb5bb703a01a147697cae69900414245850ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/3a0fb5bb703a01a147697cae69900414245850ac"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/cdb6a48a74b7b80e1bffebce6d9141ef55d18b96/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-05T23:29:11Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-05T23:29:11Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Fix APP_ENV value: map ''dev'' to ''development'' for pydantic validation\n\nThe ECS task was crashing on startup because APP_ENV was set to ''dev''\n(from var.environment) but the pydantic Settings model only accepts\n''development'', ''staging'', or ''production''. Map short env names to\nthe full values the app expects.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a25a8d3be9e6313c2063c2e3cc9b6f59d252aed2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/trees/a25a8d3be9e6313c2063c2e3cc9b6f59d252aed2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/commits/cdb6a48a74b7b80e1bffebce6d9141ef55d18b96","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/cdb6a48a74b7b80e1bffebce6d9141ef55d18b96","node_id":"C_kwDORCjIEtoAKGNkYjZhNDhhNzRiN2I4MGUxYmZmZWJjZTZkOTE0MWVmNTVkMThiOTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/2f565ac9d78338d0816a1f4dec3095554a83b41a","sha":"2f565ac9d78338d0816a1f4dec3095554a83b41a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/2f565ac9d78338d0816a1f4dec3095554a83b41a"}],"sha":"cdb6a48a74b7b80e1bffebce6d9141ef55d18b96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/cdb6a48a74b7b80e1bffebce6d9141ef55d18b96"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/2f565ac9d78338d0816a1f4dec3095554a83b41a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-05T23:18:35Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-05T23:18:35Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Fix ECS deployment: use git SHA image tag instead of :latest\n\nThe root cause of stale ECS deployments: Terraform task definition\nused :latest as the image tag. Since the string never changes,\nTerraform sees no diff and skips creating a new task definition\nrevision — so ECS keeps running the old container.\n\nAdditionally, the build workflow''s force-new-deployment call raced\nwith Terraform apply from the deploy workflow, causing conflicting\nrolling deployments on rapid pushes.\n\nFix:\n- ecs.tf: use var.image_tag instead of hardcoded \"latest\"\n- variables.tf: add image_tag variable (default \"latest\" for manual use)\n- deploy.yml: pass github.sha as TF_VAR_image_tag, wait for ECR\n  image to exist before terraform plan (build runs in parallel)\n- build-and-push-image.yml: tag image with full SHA for Terraform,\n  remove force-new-deployment (Terraform handles deployment now)\n\nEvery push now changes the task definition (new image tag), so\nTerraform always creates a new revision and ECS deploys it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"989d34f4fe07981dd3b8dd8c4c9d57e5232290f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/trees/989d34f4fe07981dd3b8dd8c4c9d57e5232290f9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/commits/2f565ac9d78338d0816a1f4dec3095554a83b41a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/2f565ac9d78338d0816a1f4dec3095554a83b41a","node_id":"C_kwDORCjIEtoAKDJmNTY1YWM5ZDc4MzM4ZDA4MTZhMWY0ZGVjMzA5NTU1NGE4M2I0MWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/5d06060e3505b00213430a7e40fa3016a4f29ed5","sha":"5d06060e3505b00213430a7e40fa3016a4f29ed5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/5d06060e3505b00213430a7e40fa3016a4f29ed5"}],"sha":"2f565ac9d78338d0816a1f4dec3095554a83b41a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/2f565ac9d78338d0816a1f4dec3095554a83b41a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/5d06060e3505b00213430a7e40fa3016a4f29ed5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-05T22:55:54Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-05T22:55:54Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"trigger CI","tree":{"sha":"3762ee9abfd1158000dfbc67c88877740eb242fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/trees/3762ee9abfd1158000dfbc67c88877740eb242fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/commits/5d06060e3505b00213430a7e40fa3016a4f29ed5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/5d06060e3505b00213430a7e40fa3016a4f29ed5","node_id":"C_kwDORCjIEtoAKDVkMDYwNjBlMzUwNWIwMDIxMzQzMGE3ZTQwZmEzMDE2YTRmMjllZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/9d4a18c512da6bcab1f48dd1c6c85123b68c874b","sha":"9d4a18c512da6bcab1f48dd1c6c85123b68c874b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/9d4a18c512da6bcab1f48dd1c6c85123b68c874b"}],"sha":"5d06060e3505b00213430a7e40fa3016a4f29ed5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/5d06060e3505b00213430a7e40fa3016a4f29ed5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/9d4a18c512da6bcab1f48dd1c6c85123b68c874b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-05T22:53:48Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-05T22:53:48Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Add item entity support: sample_items table, mappers, strategy wiring\n\nItems were already in the entity ordering and Xero had a partial\nmap_item_inbound, but there was no sample_items table, no upsert/getter\nmethods, and neither strategy wired \"item\" into _get_internal_upsert_fn.\nXero sync jobs failed with \"No internal upsert function for entity type: item\".\n\nChanges:\n- Migration 019: sample_items table (no external_id, consistent with 016)\n- InternalDataRepository: get_items, upsert_item, get_item_by_code\n- Xero mappers: fix map_item_inbound fields, add map_item_outbound,\n  extract ItemCode in bill/invoice line items with round-trip support\n- QBO mappers: add map_item_inbound/outbound, extract ItemRef from\n  ItemBasedExpenseLineDetail in bill line items\n- Both strategies: register item in upsert/getter fns, add\n  _ensure_item_synced methods for auto-fetching referenced items,\n  resolve item FKs in bill/invoice _process_inbound_record\n- Tests: 17 new tests covering mappers, line item extraction,\n  strategy registration (536 total, all passing)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3762ee9abfd1158000dfbc67c88877740eb242fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/trees/3762ee9abfd1158000dfbc67c88877740eb242fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/commits/9d4a18c512da6bcab1f48dd1c6c85123b68c874b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/9d4a18c512da6bcab1f48dd1c6c85123b68c874b","node_id":"C_kwDORCjIEtoAKDlkNGExOGM1MTJkYTZiY2FiMWY0OGRkMWM2Yzg1MTIzYjY4Yzg3NGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/22258c0a660bcd6aa8f177b4f7d8d46066091f02","sha":"22258c0a660bcd6aa8f177b4f7d8d46066091f02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/22258c0a660bcd6aa8f177b4f7d8d46066091f02"}],"sha":"9d4a18c512da6bcab1f48dd1c6c85123b68c874b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/9d4a18c512da6bcab1f48dd1c6c85123b68c874b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/22258c0a660bcd6aa8f177b4f7d8d46066091f02/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-05T19:03:05Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-05T19:03:05Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Fix lint errors in Azure/GCP queue stubs: import ordering, unused import\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aa4688d2b2cd7c1a