a7a7263030fc7317/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-26T19:46:50Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-26T19:46:50Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Decouple integration credentials from CI/CD, store in DB instead\n\nMove Xero OAuth credentials (client_id, client_secret) out of Terraform\nSecrets Manager / GitHub Actions secrets and into the existing\nconnection_config JSONB column in available_integrations — matching the\npattern QBO already uses. This makes credential management CI/CD-agnostic\nand per-environment via the DB.\n\n- Remove Xero Secrets Manager resources, variables, ECS secrets, and IAM\n  ARNs from Terraform\n- Remove TF_VAR_xero_* env vars from deploy.yml\n- Simplify integration_service auth URL builder (no env var fallback)\n- Require connection_config in Xero adapter authenticate/refresh_token\n- Remove dead qbo_client_id, qbo_client_secret, xero_client_id,\n  xero_client_secret settings from config.py (keep qbo_environment)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fa1695da1f6f5ac7c73259974eb23402abe64650","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/trees/fa1695da1f6f5ac7c73259974eb23402abe64650"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/commits/5e8ec29b2d5913edddbedebfa7a7263030fc7317","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/5e8ec29b2d5913edddbedebfa7a7263030fc7317","node_id":"C_kwDORCjIEtoAKDVlOGVjMjliMmQ1OTEzZWRkZGJlZGViZmE3YTcyNjMwMzBmYzczMTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/d0e3b19cc74083fd890061f4e2c8a3f45fa11978","sha":"d0e3b19cc74083fd890061f4e2c8a3f45fa11978","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/d0e3b19cc74083fd890061f4e2c8a3f45fa11978"}],"sha":"5e8ec29b2d5913edddbedebfa7a7263030fc7317","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/5e8ec29b2d5913edddbedebfa7a7263030fc7317"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/d0e3b19cc74083fd890061f4e2c8a3f45fa11978/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-26T17:41:01Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-26T17:41:01Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Add Xero OAuth credentials to ECS via Secrets Manager\n\n- Create Secrets Manager entries for XERO_CLIENT_ID and XERO_CLIENT_SECRET\n- Inject as env vars into ECS container definition\n- Grant task execution and task roles access to read the secrets\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2d13bb6f2525b7e13be773da06d34e4f1044f451","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/trees/2d13bb6f2525b7e13be773da06d34e4f1044f451"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/commits/d0e3b19cc74083fd890061f4e2c8a3f45fa11978","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/d0e3b19cc74083fd890061f4e2c8a3f45fa11978","node_id":"C_kwDORCjIEtoAKGQwZTNiMTljYzc0MDgzZmQ4OTAwNjFmNGUyYzhhM2Y0NWZhMTE5Nzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/1e08bcf96ba5b78000ccd803e48e2075da17d736","sha":"1e08bcf96ba5b78000ccd803e48e2075da17d736","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/1e08bcf96ba5b78000ccd803e48e2075da17d736"}],"sha":"d0e3b19cc74083fd890061f4e2c8a3f45fa11978","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/d0e3b19cc74083fd890061f4e2c8a3f45