ajiv Kumar"},"message":"Add comprehensive README documentation\n\nDocument project architecture, features, setup instructions, API endpoints,\nand development workflows. Includes guidance on adding new integrations\nand explanation of version vector sync logic.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6fb05e8c00721d6256cda0ec1f008c2b04cd5255","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/trees/6fb05e8c00721d6256cda0ec1f008c2b04cd5255"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/commits/203196b58b4ab051793158e55d6d9001b2fc5216","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/203196b58b4ab051793158e55d6d9001b2fc5216","node_id":"C_kwDORCjIEtoAKDIwMzE5NmI1OGI0YWIwNTE3OTMxNThlNTVkNmQ5MDAxYjJmYzUyMTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/c8a86ec9ff3ad7c18875471c1b0bb7a431673b59","sha":"c8a86ec9ff3ad7c18875471c1b0bb7a431673b59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/c8a86ec9ff3ad7c18875471c1b0bb7a431673b59"}],"sha":"203196b58b4ab051793158e55d6d9001b2fc5216","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/203196b58b4ab051793158e55d6d9001b2fc5216"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/c8a86ec9ff3ad7c18875471c1b0bb7a431673b59/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-28T19:02:48Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-28T19:02:48Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Add psycopg2-binary for Alembic migrations\n\nAlembic requires a sync PostgreSQL driver for running migrations.\nThe env.py converts asyncpg URLs to psycopg2, so this dependency\nis required for Docker-based development.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a2ab6aca7e48eb287696685536266fad351ade81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/trees/a2ab6aca7e48eb287696685536266fad351ade81"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/commits/c8a86ec9ff3ad7c18875471c1b0bb7a431673b59","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/c8a86ec9ff3ad7c18875471c1b0bb7a431673b59","node_id":"C_kwDORCjIEtoAKGM4YTg2ZWM5ZmYzYWQ3YzE4ODc1NDcxYzFiMGJiN2E0MzE2NzNiNTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/dfb4fdd1366cba3aa507c0e908bfbc90685f469e","sha":"dfb4fdd1366cba3aa507c0e908bfbc90685f469e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/dfb4fdd1366cba3aa507c0e908bfbc90685f469e"}],"sha":"c8a86ec9ff3ad7c18875471c1b0bb7a431673b59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/c8a86ec9ff3ad7c18875471c1b0bb7a431673b59"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/dfb4fdd1366cba3aa507c0e908bfbc90685f469e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-28T16:39:23Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-28T16:39:23Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Fix reconnection flow to use OAuth callback endpoint\n\n- OnboardingDialog now calls completeOAuthCallback instead of connectIntegration\n- Added completeOAuthCallback method to API client\n- The mock flow uses the callback endpoint which properly handles\n  reconnection of revoked integrations\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4affc0ad02cf5f90cdd23bfa56697baa6341a5df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/trees/4affc0ad02cf5f90cdd23bfa56697baa6341a5df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/commits/dfb4fdd1366cba3aa507c0e908bfbc90685f469e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/dfb4fdd1366cba3aa507c0e908bfbc90685f469e","node_id":"C_kwDORCjIEtoAKGRmYjRmZGQxMzY2Y2JhM2FhNTA3YzBlOTA4YmZiYzkwNjg1ZjQ2OWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/f060a6cf99678c793e0c7522a0123d43890c47c5","sha":"f060a6cf99678c793e0c7522a0123d43890c47c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/f060a6cf99678c793e0c7522a0123d43890c47c5"}],"sha":"dfb4fdd1366cba3aa507c0e908bfbc90685f469e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/dfb4fdd1366cba3aa507c0e908bfbc90685f469e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/f060a6cf99678c793e0c7522a0123d43890c47c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-28T16:34:59Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-28T16:34:59Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Add disconnected_at timestamp tracking for integrations\n\n- Add disconnected_at column to user_integrations table (migration 004)\n- Set disconnected_at when integration is disconnected\n- Include disconnected_at in API responses\n- Fix repository update to commit before re-reading to ensure\n  changes are visible across sessions\n- Update UI types to include disconnected_at field\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e61c56d44908b96beea69c37ea3ea84b7c196212","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/trees/e61c56d44908b96beea69c37ea3ea8