ation":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/64319845d0861d647947a2aa2b504a8a244447a3","node_id":"C_kwDORCjIEtoAKDY0MzE5ODQ1ZDA4NjFkNjQ3OTQ3YTJhYTJiNTA0YThhMjQ0NDQ3YTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/5a32aaa8f677d6971b47d2c20a6fe3efc37ce6b0","sha":"5a32aaa8f677d6971b47d2c20a6fe3efc37ce6b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/5a32aaa8f677d6971b47d2c20a6fe3efc37ce6b0"}],"sha":"64319845d0861d647947a2aa2b504a8a244447a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/64319845d0861d647947a2aa2b504a8a244447a3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/5a32aaa8f677d6971b47d2c20a6fe3efc37ce6b0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-27T22:42:09Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-27T22:42:09Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Add integrations UI micro-frontend and improve job processing\n\nBackend changes:\n- Start job runner as background task in FastAPI lifespan (shares in-memory queue)\n- Add pagination support for sync jobs API (page, page_size, total_pages)\n- Allow mock credentials in development mode for testing\n- Add /sync-jobs/{id}/execute endpoint for immediate job execution\n- Increase default stuck job timeout to 6 hours (JOB_STUCK_TIMEOUT_MINUTES=360)\n- Fix async SQLAlchemy issues with selectinload for all repository methods\n\nUI micro-frontend (Module Federation):\n- Integration tiles showing available and connected integrations\n- Mock QuickBooks onboarding flow\n- Sync jobs list with status filters and pagination\n- Job detail view with entity processing summary\n- Compact table layout with clickable row indicators\n- Auto-refresh for active jobs (pending/running)\n- Proper data isolation verified (multi-tenant)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ca24118a9e3933880a802b076fbbfb9a4acda027","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/trees/ca24118a9e3933880a802b076fbbfb9a4acda027"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/commits/5a32aaa8f677d6971b47d2c20a6fe3efc37ce6b0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/5a32aaa8f677d6971b47d2c20a6fe3efc37ce6b0","node_id":"C_kwDORCjIEtoAKDVhMzJhYWE4ZjY3N2Q2OTcxYjQ3ZDJjMjBhNmZlM2VmYzM3Y2U2YjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/4bf84b93cbf15a5b72fdf3b1068d15c57c167489","sha":"4bf84b93cbf15a5b72fdf3b1068d15c57c167489","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/4bf84b93cbf15a5b72fdf3b1068d15c57c167489"}],"sha":"5a32aaa8f677d6971b47d2c20a6fe3efc37ce6b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/5a32aaa8f677d6971b47d2c20a6fe3efc37ce6b0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/4bf84b93cbf15a5b72fdf3b1068d15c57c167489/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-27T18:25:37Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-27T18:25:37Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Add production hardening: timeouts, rate limiting, feature flags, stuck job handling\n\nSecurity & Reliability Improvements:\n- Add database statement timeout (30s default) to prevent runaway queries\n- Add external API call timeouts via httpx client module\n- Add request size limit middleware (10MB default)\n- Add message field validation in job runner to handle malformed messages\n- Add in-process rate limiting middleware (disabled by default - use API gateway)\n\nFeature Flags & Job Control:\n- Add sync_globally_disabled kill switch to stop all sync jobs\n- Add disabled_integrations list to disable specific integrations\n- Add stuck job detection and automatic termination\n- Add job_stuck_timeout_minutes and job_termination_enabled settings\n\nConcurrency & Backpressure:\n- Add backpressure with exponential backoff on consecutive errors\n- Enforce one job per client+integration (blocks if RUNNING or PENDING exists)\n- Add advisory locks to prevent race conditions in batch operations\n\nTests:\n- Add tests for concurrent job prevention (running, pending, different integrations)\n- All 104 tests passing\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ae3517c4b6018a109127e3f8afe5f5910e2aa9a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/trees/ae3517c4b6018a109127e3f8afe5f5910e2aa9a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/commits/4bf84b93cbf15a5b72fdf3b1068d15c57c167489","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/4bf84b93cbf15a5b72fdf3b1068d15c57c167489","node_id":"C_kwDORCjIEtoAKDRiZjg0YjkzY2JmMTVhNWI3MmZkZjNiMTA2OGQxNWM1N2MxNjc0ODk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/d464e6aadc956488729df4e2edd492498740a08f","sha":"d464e6aadc956488729df4e2edd492498740a08f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/d464e6aadc956488729df4e2edd492498740a08f"}],"sha":"4bf84b93cbf15a5b72fdf3b1068d15c57c167489","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/4bf84b93cbf15a5b72fdf3b1068d15c57c167489"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/d464e6aadc956488729df4e2edd492498740a08f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-27T17:20:57Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-27T17:20:57Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Add job_params column to sync_jobs for idempotent retry\n\nStore full job request params (entity_types, entity_requests) in the\nsync_jobs table so that if the queue send fails after job creation,\nthe message can be reconstructed from the database.\n\n- Add job_params JSONB column to sync_jobs table\n- Add job_params field to SyncJob entity\n- Update sync_orchestrator to build and store job_params\n- Add migration 002_add_job_params_column.py\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5bb815842c9063c68668b02599add3497189ba4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/trees/5bb815842c9063c68668b02599add3497189ba4b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/commits/d464e6aadc956488729df4e2edd492498740a08f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/d464e6aadc956488729df4e2edd492498740a08f","node_id":"C_kwDORCjIEtoAKGQ0NjRlNmFhZGM5NTY0ODg3MjlkZjRlMmVkZDQ5MjQ5ODc0MGEwOGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/857f6207e14ab7ce185b59ed2d275af737d4bd70","sha":"857f6207e14ab7ce185b59ed2d275af737d4bd70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/857f6207e14ab7ce185b59ed2d275af737d4bd70"}],"sha":"d464e6aadc956488729df4e2edd492498740a08f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/d464e6aadc956488729df4e2edd492498740a08f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/857f6207e14ab7ce185b59ed2d275af737d4bd70/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-27T17:05:10Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-27T17:05:10Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Add sample QuickBooks sync job with queue-based processing\n\n- Add EntitySyncRequest model to support specific record IDs in sync jobs\n- Create QuickBooks mock adapter with detailed sync activity logging\n- Register QuickBooks adapter in adapter factory\n- Add record_ids parameter to fetch_records interface for targeted syncs\n- Create demo script (scripts/demo_sync_job.py) showing end-to-end flow:\n  - Job triggered by user (simulates UI button click)\n  - Request sent to SQS queue (using in-memory queue for demo)\n  - Job runner consumes message and routes to correct adapter\n  - Mock sync prints record details (vendors, bills, invoices)\n  - Supports --entity-types and --specific-records CLI options\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c331f41cb64d0f9f925ddec0c5fa9848798b9d35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/trees/c331f41cb64d0f9f925ddec0c5fa9848798b9d35"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/commits/857f6207e14ab7ce185b59ed2d275af737d4bd70","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/857f6207e14ab7ce185b59ed2d275af737d4bd70","node_id":"C_kwDORCjIEtoAKDg1N2Y2MjA3ZTE0YWI3Y2UxODViNTllZDJkMjc1YWY3MzdkNGJkNzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/1c5e2696ad7a99b5acebca3e3937b84ed028fd3f","sha":"1c5e2696ad7a99b5acebca3e3937b84ed028fd3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/1c5e2696ad7a99b5acebca3e3937b84ed028fd3f"}],"sha":"857f6207e14ab7ce185b59ed2d275af737d4bd70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/857f6207e14ab7ce185b59ed2d275af737d4bd70"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/1c5e2696ad7a99b5acebca3e3937b84ed028fd3f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-27T16:50:49Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-27T16:50:49Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Initial commit: Integration platform with conflict resolution support\n\nMulti-tenant integration platform for syncing data between SaaS products and\nexternal systems. Key features:\n- Generic/configurable integrations stored in database\n- OAuth flow for connecting integrations (QuickBooks, Xero, NetSuite, etc.)\n- Sync job orchestration with queue-based async processing\n- User-configurable sync rules with master_if_conflict for conflict resolution\n- Range-partitioned integration_state table for scalability\n- AWS infrastructure (ECS, RDS, SQS, KMS) with Terraform\n- 101 unit tests with 49% code coverage\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e76753c4957bc099dffa223cf45dedbd49e4eaa1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/trees/e76753c4957bc099dffa223cf45dedbd49e4eaa1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/git/commits/1c5e2696ad7a99b5acebca3e3937b84ed028fd3f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commit/1c5e2696ad7a99b5acebca3e3937b84ed028fd3f","node_id":"C_kwDORCjIEtoAKDFjNWUyNjk2YWQ3YTk5YjVhY2ViY2EzZTM5MzdiODRlZDAyOGZkM2Y","parents":[],"sha":"1c5e2696ad7a99b5acebca3e3937b84ed028fd3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits/1c5e2696ad7a99b5acebca3e3937b84ed028fd3f"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/integration-platform/commits?per_page=100&page=2&sha=7003817c1df78b4e6da28b5e6a859806f8e4f551&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T15%3A57%3A47.262Z"}');
