":"https://api.github.com/users/oscarosorio-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oscarosorio-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oscarosorio-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oscarosorio-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oscarosorio-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarDamian/Onboarding-Candidate-Profile-Intelligence-Platform/commits/290888d862897ec7e5b645074c1466ce8662b7e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-12T22:48:59Z","email":"132024122+OsOsorioP@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Oscar Osorio"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-12T22:48:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: implement, improve, general arrangements and checklist\n\n## Summary\n\nIntroduces core improvements across the API, ETL, and async processing architecture. It standardizes API error handling, strengthens schema validation, adds Redis-based job queuing and caching, and improves LLM reliability with Groq fallback support. Documentation and environment configuration were updated to reflect the new architecture.\n\n### Key Changes\n\n#### API (FastAPI)\n\n- Standard error handling with custom exceptions.\n- OpenAPI documentation improvements.\n- Schema fixes and new search response schema.\n- Test configuration added.\n- LangChain + Groq integration with LLM fallback.\n\n#### ETL & Pipelines\n\n- Field-level validation added and isolated.\n- Async full reindex support.\n- \n#### Async Jobs & Redis\n- Redis configuration and environment variables (REDIS_URL, REDIS_QUEUE).\n- Job queuing for candidate indexing, deletion, and full reindex.\n- Redis caching for candidate insights.\n- Test updates for async processing (Redis/Qdrant).\n\n#### Config & Docs\n\n- Environment and dependency updates.\n- README and architecture docs updated (error handling, async jobs, fallback ADR).\n\n#### Notes for Deployment\n- Ensure Redis is configured and available.\n- Set REDIS_URL and REDIS_QUEUE.\n- Update dependencies before deploy.","tree":{"sha":"20803245aaa0b6a83eb70b7112f61659b2ead318","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarDamian/Onboarding-Candidate-Profile-Intelligence-Platform/git/trees/20803245aaa0b6a83eb70b7112f61659b2ead318"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarDamian/Onboarding-Candidate-Profile-Intelligence-Platform/git/commits/290888d862897ec7e5b645074c1466ce8662b7e0","verification":{"payload":"tree 20803245aaa0b6a83eb70b7112f61659b2ead318\nparent f645b1655009888eb9e6db41cf8c2d9e113b9ffe\nparent 0f82fd3f992d2add2b7b62aea983a36e9bbce5bf\nauthor Oscar Osorio <132024122+OsOsorioP@users.noreply.github.com> 1770936539 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1770936539 -0500\n\nfeat: implement, improve, general arrangements and checklist\n\n## Summary\n\nIntroduces core improvements across the API, ETL, and async processing architecture. It standardizes API error handling, strengthens schema validation, adds Redis-based job queuing and caching, and improves LLM reliability with Groq fallback support. Documentation and environment configuration were updated to reflect the new architecture.\n\n### Key Changes\n\n#### API (FastAPI)\n\n- Standard error handling with custom exceptions.\n- OpenAPI documentation improvements.\n- Schema fixes and new search response schema.\n- Test configuration added.\n- LangChain + Groq integration with LLM fallback.\n\n#### ETL & Pipelines\n\n- Field-level validation added and isolated.\n- Async full reindex support.\n- \n#### Async Jobs & Redis\n- Redis configuration and environment variables (REDIS_URL, REDIS_QUEUE).\n- Job queuing for candidate indexing, deletion, and full reindex.\n- Redis caching for candidate insights.\n- Test updates for async processing (Redis/Qdrant).\n\n#### Config & Docs\n\n- Environment and dependency updates.\n- README and architecture docs updated (error handling, async jobs, fallback ADR).\n\n#### Notes for Deployment\n- Ensure Redis is configured and available.\n- Set REDIS_URL and REDIS_QUEUE.\n- Update dependencies before deploy.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpjljbCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAdvUQABu5L1GT2WOs+kzK4ogtTAdA\nUEw2CfqC00SggyGwZckrB35dGKGtuuptXAkIG1bGEZG7yMUCq0McY/iB+9HQcUuu\ni2I5zHOZrvf3g3bwIno1efKmKupnbC8MyxhefbFf9Pykt7QRLh+BkpO5lpwyu1tH\nb/qdyZyTyWKszupkXnJL5Sra6rmWBSYwK888n0gyvZce0eOj79m2+5gjuAnjQPqU\nsqFLYImNkjaShTrqkd5ToYup+wqbSvsOL+M+VHuzOxMMegXMgEG7QfERHucvoBkn\nlbhXjZpQKJISsSqksPpGlSfvfiWLAUsWyPdY06BAxQTjS1/Os2cVKZtpefj/qY12\nfx5rhuvx2A0qjWvamhMzjw2i5y2dTIjjkayUG0eGAh+onrjWnvUrosLu35o9EAlD\n+sakMsWFcgCYYwkFri1vbqkgQF8xoDa0677oLYoIihMyILW7HvL5yoDsye5EO0oI\nK9VOwbvHY2UFr+FIv5opAwOOeA06c7BPLnq5h2IuIfzU1dXZTGozmXnU5jbkRjeO\ngITD0uddb6Dxl3Vxi69b/LN5lI6UnOwFWvBOBWwMCcCQZtOZM/NlQhZZt4Gxmxlp\nLlv8d4LKAn2OfKsmO/lxsI4KzdVEv/KAuE8LGiCjcz/69wmiHg6C4e7yCiY4eFCb\n6TKdVGMfj2xXLfLzop+8\n=STXY\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-02-12T22:49:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","