events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lieut-data/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lieut-data/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lieut-data/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lieut-data/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lieut-data","id":1023171,"login":"lieut-data","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMjMxNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lieut-data/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lieut-data/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lieut-data/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lieut-data/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lieut-data/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lieut-data","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unity-Billal-mesloub/mattermost/commits/4c6c5a063fefa1ec4484f62e1a209ec79711da13/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T18:51:58Z","email":"jesse.hallam@gmail.com","name":"Jesse Hallam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T18:51:58Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Graduate Enable Channel Viewed WebSocket Messages to Environment > Web Server (#38026)\n\n* [MM-57806] Graduate Enable Channel Viewed WebSocket Messages\n\nMove ServiceSettings.EnableChannelViewedMessages out of System Console >\nExperimental > Features and into Environment > Web Server, alongside the\nother ServiceSettings transport and performance knobs it belongs with.\n\nThe access tag changes from experimental_features to environment_web_server,\nso the setting is now governed by sysconsole_read/write_environment_web_server.\nwrite_restrictable and cloud_restrictable are preserved, the default remains\ntrue, and the client config continues to publish the value. No runtime\nbehavior changes.\n\nThe i18n ids move from the admin.experimental.* namespace to the\nadmin.service.* namespace used by the rest of the Web Server page.\n\n* [MM-57806] Document channel viewed WebSocket messages under Environment\n\nMove the Enable Channel Viewed WebSocket Messages entry from the\nexperimental configuration settings page to the Web Server section of the\nenvironment configuration settings page, matching its new System Console\nlocation, and reformat it to the two-column table style used there.\n\n* [MM-57806] Cover the new location of the channel viewed setting\n\nAssert that the setting is defined on the Environment > Web Server page,\nthat it is gated on write access to the Web Server console resource rather\nthan to Experimental Features, and that searching the admin console for\n\"channel_viewed\" resolves to environment/web_server.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Mattermost Build <build@mattermost.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>","tree":{"sha":"b342aa0bc25d40bcd590b028ba7645769885275c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unity-Billal-mesloub/mattermost/git/trees/b342aa0bc25d40bcd590b028ba7645769885275c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unity-Billal-mesloub/mattermost/git/commits/4c6c5a063fefa1ec4484f62e1a209ec79711da13","verification":{"payload":"tree b342aa0bc25d40bcd590b028ba7645769885275c\nparent 9127a7d9b9c5529d9cc8da1fa5a3f210804400e8\nauthor Jesse Hallam <jesse.hallam@gmail.com> 1787165518 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787165518 -0300\n\nGraduate Enable Channel Viewed WebSocket Messages to Environment > Web Server (#38026)\n\n* [MM-57806] Graduate Enable Channel Viewed WebSocket Messages\n\nMove ServiceSettings.EnableChannelViewedMessages out of System Console >\nExperimental > Features and into Environment > Web Server, alongside the\nother ServiceSettings transport and performance knobs it belongs with.\n\nThe access tag changes from experimental_features to environment_web_server,\nso the setting is now governed by sysconsole_read/write_environment_web_server.\nwrite_restrictable and cloud_restrictable are preserved, the default remains\ntrue, and the client config continues to publish the value. No runtime\nbehavior changes.\n\nThe i18n ids move from the admin.experimental.* namespace to the\nadmin.service.* namespace used by the rest of the Web Server page.\n\n* [MM-57806] Document channel viewed WebSocket messages under Environment\n\nMove the Enable Channel Viewed WebSocket Messages entry from the\nexperimental configuration settings page to the Web Server section of the\nenvironment configuration settings page, matching its new System Console\nlocation, and reformat it to the two-column table style used there.\n\n* [MM-57806] Cover the new location of the channel viewed setting\n\nAssert that the setting is defined on the Environment > Web Server page,\nthat it is gated on write access to the Web Server console resource rather\nthan to Experimental Features, and that searching the admin console for\n\"channel_viewed\" resolves to environment/web_server.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Mattermost Build <build@mattermost.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhftOCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAXw8QAHAN7ezH+sGEkNvElOTaU40c\nBtpZR4+jK8FwD27WRBusI6ysZ8Pd3uAYHbEsghEmxp85tIsr/Me0lZWLsEwifUtT\n/sZ0dS/q/OY6FiMrSXri13OayEULfUuw9X+dlTp5H+5Q+E3z/oz8CWeSYIFAui5A\nILHWFcx7Ef+cdX+XICoieL6LfCiRFoN1BvhFBeFr/+DvahQiwTn2GL/C2RIr+fTR\nXARG134tEbi+Plo4NcsLMg0DzQc3jw6DSZghYbtHt4BcnBApxqD8UoT6ukiwz3S5\nCBnQ617tBLmEUZU9ShDC6IaveXH54LAAqyumXXW/aw2cYUOLEOcKC1NKXLVqo3DC\nHTk3TNnA4xoD9aZzJl+/RB//LG7Zw6DXGqEQD55QYWHh+FekendankVOcOhFta+x\n1m2eokdltCuLy3UY9+hsjJ/HvjGbQucYF+Cj3eiJnJkp8p5hzTyGKltf0p5PsgQ8\neQpi/7QXCbY+BopF5zIiT+TxjgsH7LrmF0aVD+9JOMGxsqpvMnhM1/F7KVO6dBtO\nG7u2Z9PT/AKOOUwDTE4cPHxZRQRWMQPgvw7KnVh/vKqzx1P6kY49pPGQaEaJQk42\n