lowing_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmhealey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmhealey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hmhealey","id":3277310,"login":"hmhealey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzczMTA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmhealey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmhealey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmhealey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmhealey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmhealey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmhealey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unity-Billal-mesloub/mattermost/commits/9127a7d9b9c5529d9cc8da1fa5a3f210804400e8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T15:09:56Z","email":"harrisonmhealey@gmail.com","name":"Harrison Healey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T15:09:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"MM-69835 Update React Bootstrap to support React 19 (#37758)\n\n* Update RB to latest version of fork\n\n* Update most snapshots to remove extraneous div\n\n* Forward ref to menu passed to RB Dropdown\n\n* Update unusual tests broken by RB update\n\n* Patch react-overlays to still close modal when default prevented\n\nThe old version of react-overlays that we had ignored this, but the newer version\ncauses the modal to not close when preventDefault is called on the escape keyboard\nevent. React Select always does that and some other components like the SuggestionBox\nsometimes prevent default, and it doesn''t seem like Floating UI or MUI look at\npreventDefault to know whether or not to close the modal, so I think React Overlays\nis the correct place for this patch.\n\n* Remove @types/react-overlays in favour of built-in definitions\n\n* Update RB to merged commit","tree":{"sha":"02a02d5b8a05f23e1141a2653e68bdfd2697dc91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unity-Billal-mesloub/mattermost/git/trees/02a02d5b8a05f23e1141a2653e68bdfd2697dc91"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unity-Billal-mesloub/mattermost/git/commits/9127a7d9b9c5529d9cc8da1fa5a3f210804400e8","verification":{"payload":"tree 02a02d5b8a05f23e1141a2653e68bdfd2697dc91\nparent 19ffbc9c75928a50d3e10e2968aaf04b13c5a8e2\nauthor Harrison Healey <harrisonmhealey@gmail.com> 1787152196 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787152196 -0400\n\nMM-69835 Update React Bootstrap to support React 19 (#37758)\n\n* Update RB to latest version of fork\n\n* Update most snapshots to remove extraneous div\n\n* Forward ref to menu passed to RB Dropdown\n\n* Update unusual tests broken by RB update\n\n* Patch react-overlays to still close modal when default prevented\n\nThe old version of react-overlays that we had ignored this, but the newer version\ncauses the modal to not close when preventDefault is called on the escape keyboard\nevent. React Select always does that and some other components like the SuggestionBox\nsometimes prevent default, and it doesn''t seem like Floating UI or MUI look at\npreventDefault to know whether or not to close the modal, so I think React Overlays\nis the correct place for this patch.\n\n* Remove @types/react-overlays in favour of built-in definitions\n\n* Update RB to merged commit","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhcdECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAMzwQAKUfw20UUW7fT2U8fb51ffUj\n7dpbjnlpdrwB59lMPKPxHFwq9JofbLj2zE9w0U9zGBc/32Ebw/KqXCTkd3ZfCVVT\nSu+LM6T2YsI7lmaNfDhNCkZkTnzRzE/ChKo/Rcbpi3mgpQ5XNaERLvGNIRpZC46i\nfKrD0G8RJB0MvtD7qLS1f8WeblDCGAXEw+mGfRoLBNvfTww3ildze5RrQGNxLlKi\n0OneyEI1RUXMnDuXReDba7dojfEzWwSc8WGMp0PTutPNXWpgUMN5dprN1HpLWPP7\nOY+PH89lXVn/25HdgIxUmXEyXuQsJDHPuPBkw8ZXo1nZI+GV47koKJW9cHvpKG6i\n50ccG4/RdhMwJtqyk7yI+ojHeM1jZF02p+rt50iApRwBkzvuyP5Nc0/EQutkULjR\nQtJ8KYZfGaqLBW3oCkG/dl+SZrA7afdA5IqoCQQ8xaJM8scJbfO3IT0421FpwU3u\nzQ5zXK7jGoJNo