r / EmailLoginButtonTextColor, but no client — web or\nmobile — ever consumed them, so the email login button was never colored by\nthese values.\n\nRemove the fields from the config struct and its defaults, drop the three client\nconfig props, and update the config fixtures that carried them.\n\nAlso fixes MM-57556 and MM-57804, and follows the same removal already done for\nthe AD/LDAP (MM-70140) and SAML (MM-70141) equivalents.\n\n* [MM-57557] Remove Email login button colors from the webapp and docs\n\nDrop the three Email Login Button Color settings from the Admin Console\nExperimental Features section along with their en.json strings, remove the\nmatching ClientConfig and AdminConfig EmailSettings entries to stay in sync with\nthe server model, and delete the corresponding documentation entries.\n\nThe experimental settings doc''s jq example referenced\nEmailSettings.LoginButtonColor, which no longer exists; point it at\nEmailSettings.EmailBatchingBufferSize instead.","tree":{"sha":"09e404504f0b6dd4aca4043a435221dac3d1785f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unity-Billal-mesloub/mattermost/git/trees/09e404504f0b6dd4aca4043a435221dac3d1785f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unity-Billal-mesloub/mattermost/git/commits/925a09a5f22180b3250c2bd0c2a006cfea65aee5","verification":{"payload":"tree 09e404504f0b6dd4aca4043a435221dac3d1785f\nparent 0bff02c8148abbea87f260c28839ae2ab4da3aee\nauthor Jesse Hallam <jesse.hallam@gmail.com> 1787088963 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787088963 -0400\n\nRemove dead Email login button color settings (#38021)\n\n* [MM-57557] Remove dead Email login button color settings from the server\n\nEmailSettings.LoginButtonColor, LoginButtonBorderColor and LoginButtonTextColor\nwere plumbed into the client config as EmailLoginButtonColor /\nEmailLoginButtonBorderColor / EmailLoginButtonTextColor, but no client — web or\nmobile — ever consumed them, so the email login button was never colored by\nthese values.\n\nRemove the fields from the config struct and its defaults, drop the three client\nconfig props, and update the config fixtures that carried them.\n\nAlso fixes MM-57556 and MM-57804, and follows the same removal already done for\nthe AD/LDAP (MM-70140) and SAML (MM-70141) equivalents.\n\n* [MM-57557] Remove Email login button colors from the webapp and docs\n\nDrop the three Email Login Button Color settings from the Admin Console\nExperimental Features section along with their en.json strings, remove the\nmatching ClientConfig and AdminConfig EmailSettings entries to stay in sync with\nthe server model, and delete the corresponding documentation entries.\n\nThe experimental settings doc''s jq example referenced\nEmailSettings.LoginButtonColor, which no longer exists; point it at\nEmailSettings.EmailBatchingBufferSize instead.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhNBDCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAr0wQAJZY7oE8juaJUJ7NA7AQWrqo\nBN1L9vWTKARjwk3V8ynkMSE4zmXLw3oietUGgM7Xpv6fQmIs7qvS7P8gWyK1Zm9K\nSEaOnnje23XoGZoIoxu1W4duuZpDvPAwypjgqQ9fa59L594Rn1hQHO7jgjQJXm76\nST9Lw/y1CtqgfDFnxJeJF6CDRy/yOEqWE1lSc9y9fI5LWR04s0TDc7uCbCKSq9F+\n1Z3+QRZWokSTmGq8N5L2/pCcLiv4+Ky5DEH7zBFYiQgqbnkMocTlTAV6GVu3uYir\n6mSSGlbMgKR8EBUTs1W03TuDRIzGhkQF5rt8BVYXrVh9k2ANkHhwXc3ElIh2Zfr/\nRsg3DBHarh7b/CZC8+g5lYxRwovBYy1ZQmci7jghe2Kx02FgagTCqFJCij17HdST\nVzeHzatE1fruUuXfjE505SnBVWvcmUZzoT4XlyR1Jhmzr/dwjgU+J7cI5t1KHKhx\nxqJNI8k1HEGkW9MYAAqVsWKfwNZFju0b56F5ETerFytIqpYwxG+ksbtj95idZRQb\nuRT+KdYQjGodCAiBtxPt4OTBFw9oeETMOSas6GSlS7MB4+m/Do/E81phsDsBtgpX\noglOb/E161sPUEdqZ/kgLbD/m8uMEWhcMWZSw5Y81mx+7kMvq5nuNld1cl6zFzZy\nbVyX++XGWEDrA6S+bc6a\n=R2Fp\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-18T21:36:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-