ursor%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unity-Billal-mesloub/mattermost/commits/3f02a0a1ac705d9900cbea8f82cb10df7e37b3ce/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T12:07:37Z","email":"206951365+cursor[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"cursor[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T12:07:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[MM-70283] Fix mixed custom-section fallback hiding valid plugin settings (#38004)\n\n* [MM-70283] Fix mixed custom-section fallback hiding valid fallback settings\n\nWhen a disabled plugin defined multiple custom settings sections and only\nsome specified fallback: true, the settings page collapsed every section\ninto a single \"enable the plugin\" warning, hiding the fallback-enabled\nsections that should remain configurable.\n\nThe collapse now only happens when no custom section allows a fallback.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* [MM-70283] Add test for mixed custom-section fallback\n\nCovers a disabled plugin with mixed fallback sections: the fallback-enabled\nsection stays configurable, the non-fallback section shows a per-section\nwarning, and the single collapse warning is not rendered.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* [MM-70283] Improve mixed custom-section fallback tests\n\nRename the visibility test to match its assertions, add an\norder-independent case, and assert non-fallback section settings are\nsuppressed.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* [MM-70283] Tighten fallback comment wording\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>","tree":{"sha":"d9d84e015842db740f5269327e8db9016e4ae6f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unity-Billal-mesloub/mattermost/git/trees/d9d84e015842db740f5269327e8db9016e4ae6f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unity-Billal-mesloub/mattermost/git/commits/3f02a0a1ac705d9900cbea8f82cb10df7e37b3ce","verification":{"payload":"tree d9d84e015842db740f5269327e8db9016e4ae6f3\nparent 2b40a0bdaeb80e022dab022c3ef352ec170881a2\nauthor cursor[bot] <206951365+cursor[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1786968457 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786968457 +0200\n\n[MM-70283] Fix mixed custom-section fallback hiding valid plugin settings (#38004)\n\n* [MM-70283] Fix mixed custom-section fallback hiding valid fallback settings\n\nWhen a disabled plugin defined multiple custom settings sections and only\nsome specified fallback: true, the settings page collapsed every section\ninto a single \"enable the plugin\" warning, hiding the fallback-enabled\nsections that should remain configurable.\n\nThe collapse now only happens when no custom section allows a fallback.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* [MM-70283] Add test for mixed custom-section fallback\n\nCovers a disabled plugin with mixed fallback sections: the fallback-enabled\nsection stays configurable, the non-fallback section shows a per-section\nwarning, and the single collapse warning is not rendered.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* [MM-70283] Improve mixed custom-section fallback tests\n\nRename the visibility test to match its assertions, add an\norder-independent case, and assert non-fallback section settings are\nsuppressed.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* [MM-70283] Tighten fallback comment wording\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqgvmJCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA1sQQAA4MjQEZb0chUGTeSQhQchpw\n1lDzrwEIAmMYLlbiZ4mH0ydqGTfDgVThGe7+Qnadi919C1y2nOWRBeB20rrc7/yi\nwzvHpHHGIK2HklmEOwjTg7J8kTFCNE074Ptg6NV6J/0KD6cEnlPak4Vy9GQg2F+d\n6MfsKvgZSePrrXVX1PalOoXMZq47od7xgimr70MiE0pwzuiT4OVr/BQf8JacwUHF\nCIj0NmiRa9/h+VZ+4riaqD4CrxZH8UTbrGcoRPHjFmw8wAbQxOp9uSaKUPo3DHu+\ngjqtXoaqnMNR/zgUEgTwsU1ZqK6GXF32vNG3j39jGMYoxv5GkVG9pNshrHyhdovI\nzfUGza3eZExd5f4tmpnppo3ihvw7BeKjC0Lz2YCvnuAJj3IVBos2F/2IW9hF7Lqq\nFLHidtEEVkA1h7KZ0UbW7UySARDAam4e4rDCeNb/RDYFbIuAprt1ERyW+dYIkp1c\nVaERewC62O+a2FQ/856mdnjZfdHi6hcNReVnYGItYCRPFHWMCR6e0m8LAISO9dbT\nkUjFH0rH80zm4dDnN+3CiPO8kFPGFnP1z1iVeSe7PO4Iq1tfl3KB1DIO67HDJSX5\n+HR+oZMFtp3v23G+LVuzuQtRoxnxIMOEygJrx5K57fkqn+834MFj+FntdYrexckT\ntaJPfYJ4Uc1FyM8SNv1b\n=s1F5\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-17T12:07:38Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":