33461d83af94c21cdc62eaef3d2d"}],"sha":"2b40a0bdaeb80e022dab022c3ef352ec170881a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unity-Billal-mesloub/mattermost/commits/2b40a0bdaeb80e022dab022c3ef352ec170881a2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16541325?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanzei/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanzei/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanzei/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanzei/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hanzei","id":16541325,"login":"hanzei","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTQxMzI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanzei/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanzei/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanzei/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanzei/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanzei/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanzei","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unity-Billal-mesloub/mattermost/commits/ea183fab48b833461d83af94c21cdc62eaef3d2d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T06:43:18Z","email":"ben.schumacher@mattermost.com","name":"Ben Schumacher"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T06:43:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[MM-67157] Remove format parameter requirement from client license endpoint (#37167)\n\n* MM-67157: Remove unused format flag from /license/client endpoint\n\nThe `format` query parameter on the `/license/client` (and local\nvariant) endpoint was effectively dead: it was required but only ever\naccepted the single value `old`, returning an error otherwise. This\nmirrors the earlier removal of the same flag from `/config/client`,\nwhere the server now ignores the parameter while clients continue to\nsend `format=old` for compatibility with pre-v11 servers.\n\nThe server no longer inspects the `format` parameter, so requests with\nno format, `format=old`, or any other value all succeed. The unused\ni18n string and the parameter/response documentation in the OpenAPI\nspec are removed accordingly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018Audz4JLNQN5SJxcPwyQBd\n\n* MM-67157: document format=old retention in webapp client\n\nMirror the getClientConfig comment so the format=old query param on\ngetClientLicenseOld is not mistakenly removed; clients keep sending it\nfor compatibility with pre-v11 servers even though current servers now\nignore it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018Audz4JLNQN5SJxcPwyQBd\n\n* MM-67157: stop sending format=old from webapp client\n\nNow that the server ignores the format parameter on /license/client,\ndrop format=old from the @mattermost/client getClientLicenseOld call and\nupdate the e2e intercepts/helpers that matched the old query string.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018Audz4JLNQN5SJxcPwyQBd\n\n* Drop unneeded wildcard from license/client cy.intercept path\n\nThe format query param is gone from GET /license/client requests, so\nthe trailing * used to match it is no longer needed.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"324a473d6ef85d774236b36965b6f7a2491491ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unity-Billal-mesloub/mattermost/git/trees/324a473d6ef85d774236b36965b6f7a2491491ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unity-Billal-mesloub/mattermost/git/commits/ea183fab48b833461d83af94c21cdc62eaef3d2d","verification":{"payload":"tree 324a473d6ef85d774236b36965b6f7a2491491ad\nparent 505d6c1ecf4cb9d62bcc6a8ad100d0ba67c630c9\nauthor Ben Schumacher <ben.schumacher@mattermost.com> 1786948998 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786948998 +0200\n\n[MM-67157] Remove format parameter requirement from client license endpoint (#37167)\n\n* MM-67157: Remove unused format flag from /license/client endpoint\n\nThe `format` query parameter on the `/license/client` (and local\nvariant) endpoint was effectively dead: it was required but only ever\naccepted the single value `old`, returning an error otherwise. This\nmirrors the earlier removal of the same flag from `/config/client`,\nwhere the server now ignores the parameter while clients continue to\nsend `format=old` for compatibility with pre-v11 servers.\n\nThe server no longer inspects the `format` parameter, so requests with\nno format, `format=old`, or any other value all succeed. The unused\ni18n string and the parameter/response documentation in the OpenAPI\nspec are removed accordingly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018Audz4JLNQN5SJxcPwyQBd\n\n* MM-67157: document format=old retention in webapp client\n\nMirror the getClientConfig comment so the format=old query param on\ngetClientLicenseOld is not mistakenly removed; clients keep sending it\nfor compatibility with pre-v11 servers even though current servers now\nignore it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018Audz4JLNQN5SJxcPwyQBd\n\n* MM-67157: stop sending format=old from webapp client\n\nNow that the server ignores the format parameter on /license/client,\ndrop format=old from the @mattermost/client getClientLicenseOld call and\nupdate the e2e intercepts/helpers that matched the old query string.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018Audz4JLNQN5SJxcPwyQBd\n\n* Drop unneeded wildcard from license/client cy.intercept path\n\nThe format query param is gone from GET /license/client requests, so\nthe trailing * used to match it is no longer needed.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqgq2GCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKSYQAB+qX145yQ8Mtvlc5Qppf5QO\nL17bIcj9znuyGitOBnhZ5T3iW4R0QZoe2jB4EJFGkEIA4MDVHXyA+Xb/NEhgImqH\nN9DIkl6gPQ5/24FMwTGJUrFBthGXx/bk8CLpyup8h0V2waSF/Sb/ucvDRRTcVeMt\nM6qWggiStVuE43BQJRVXEuo1RcbUgQWNSnoeGE7/z7lgc4UFsi1u2f+HTt+W/c67\n3eNDQZ5+0rqTQQwHleTFfAHNyZfxfPcEVEEQLenGKfmc4NvdeCs+3Ql63Pous649\nDgpiFPb2LNZE+SslB3YPDUMIyqZz6cTOLRNEOtNdSq+SyDpG4V2T4yj9g+KqBiJJ\nXD+QR9BscNOUVGTY+YifggmJIfh4SrROoU8UNPrvyZcWZH8ho48F4H4qpefHRhSg\nNaeR6AFLejhvrm+c8ZgT5AhlZoPrDilRrIBFeJioi3ceeQeVZ6SnYkcg5yEKKo5X\njx6pNhUUn5SrsJnKmdxOx2UIPfa2YWDxxFAgpTLLMfniLdGCTYaj8doUn7lj1Jbe\nZwuZeJ8Z+/cAcpa7iYKqoyGTSEY1nR6GDJk56guG+bA7qbZYNvL0M4IawyKI5yGt\nJmv8c5Wfj57VjfGuJyXWoP0pUUkuJdvzoNYm4zT9DqCz3DtPQAYvBjzgCreHHQnE\n+kZ7PnkMrquelIcUyXYc\n=Vi7U\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-17T06:43:18Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Unity-Billal-mesloub/mattermost/commi