thor":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1210556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/cursor","id":206951365,"login":"cursor[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDODFXTxQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unity-Billal-mesloub/mattermost/commits/7831d7fbf138024b7653af90ab2c09bef86d9be0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T07:24:45Z","email":"206951365+cursor[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"cursor[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T07:24:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[MM-69226] Fix Manage Teams role dropdown overflowing outside the modal (#37400)\n\n* Fix Manage Teams dropdown overflowing outside modal for last rows\n\nThe role dropdown in the Admin Console Manage Teams modal always opened\ndownward, so for users with many teams the menu for the last rows was\npushed below the modal and out of view. Compute openUp for rows near the\nbottom of the list, mirroring the TeamMembersDropdown behavior.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* Render Manage Teams role dropdown via floating menu to fix overflow\n\nMigrate ManageTeamsDropdown from the deprecated Menu/MenuWrapper widget to\nthe modern components/menu (MUI Popover). The old widget positioned the\nmenu relative to the modal content, so for users with many teams the role\ndropdown on the last rows was pushed below the modal and off-screen. The\nnew menu renders in a portal anchored to the trigger and opens upward for\nrows near the bottom of the list, mirroring TeamMembersDropdown.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* Add openUp helper coverage and action tests for ManageTeamsDropdown\n\nExtract the open-up positioning rule into a testable shouldOpenUp helper\nand cover its boundaries, plus the demote and error paths, so the fix for\nthe dropdown overflow is exercised directly.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* Satisfy lint for table-driven test comment\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* Gate onMemberChange assertions behind waitFor in dropdown tests\n\nMove onMemberChange expectations inside waitFor so they wait for the\nasync updateTeamMemberSchemeRoles promise to resolve before asserting.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* Fix Manage Teams e2e to target MUI menu button and items\n\nThe Manage Teams role dropdown was migrated from the deprecated\ncomponents/widgets/menu (div.MenuWrapper) to the modern components/menu\n(MUI Popover). The Playwright spec still clicked div.MenuWrapper and\nlooked for menu items inside the team row, but the new menu renders in a\nportal. Target the accessible role button and role menuitem elements\ninstead.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>","tree":{"sha":"1a32dff63d560d6adbb503bc60ac55d1c15fd545","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unity-Billal-mesloub/mattermost/git/trees/1a32dff63d560d6adbb503bc60ac55d1c15fd545"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unity-Billal-mesloub/mattermost/git/commits/7831d7fbf138024b7653af90ab2c09bef86d9be0","verification":{"payload":"tree 1a32dff63d560d6adbb503bc60ac55d1c15fd545\nparent 0eb2ec5a1771b82c905cb9d50491dc85326a3530\nauthor cursor[bot] <206951365+cursor[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1786605885 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786605885 +0200\n\n[MM-69226] Fix Manage Teams role dropdown overflowing outside the modal (#37400)\n\n* Fix Manage Teams dropdown overflowing outside modal for last rows\n\nThe role dropdown in the Admin Console Manage Teams modal always opened\ndownward, so for users with many teams the menu for the last rows was\npushed below the modal and out of view. Compute openUp for rows near the\nbottom of the list, mirroring the TeamMembersDropdown behavior.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* Render Manage Teams role dropdown via floating menu to fix overflow\n\nMigrate ManageTeamsDropdown from the deprecated Menu/MenuWrapper widget to\nthe modern components/menu (MUI Popover). The old widget positioned the\nmenu relative to the modal content, so for users with many teams the role\ndropdown on the last rows was pushed below the modal and off-screen. The\nnew menu renders in a portal anchored to the trigger and opens upward for\nrows near the bottom of the list, mirroring TeamMembersDropdown.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* Add openUp helper coverage and action tests for ManageTeamsDropdown\n\nExtract the open-up positioning rule into a testable shouldOpenUp helper\nand cover its boundaries, plus the demote and error paths, so the fix for\nthe dropdown overflow is exercised directly.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* Satisfy lint for table-driven test comment\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* Gate onMemberChange assertions behind waitFor in dropdown tests\n\nMove onMemberChange expectations inside waitFor so they wait for the\nasync updateTeamMemberSchemeRoles promise to resolve before asserting.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* Fix Manage Teams e2e to target MUI menu button and items\n\nThe Manage Teams role dropdown was migrated from the deprecated\ncomponents/widgets/menu (div.MenuWrapper) to the modern components/menu\n(MUI Popover). The Playwright spec still clicked div.MenuWrapper and\nlooked for menu items inside the team row, but the new menu renders in a\nportal. Target the accessible role button and role menuitem elements\ninstead.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfXE9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYfwQABRLBtVFmZr0lKl5AeEcqURL\nXFePlxarC35O6I/Z8QbawTo0sWExkL2u5dMWz1Tx5K+G1FJcaGG6eBkzHpSOBhfl\nwR885USPjBCSp8ZDEReV/SuJj0CCzqhIhTPtkV9wmcP8cAnQl0hJBL2Mb54l+Rgg\nwWzpAUeMzxxq1AEgxxJcszvrzMDMbRTi8KJVyUf+RngR2VA81rJz/5q9cB1VZjQp\npAVkv/5RCyOK+hl7+5xntQ1URTN7RtvrhBNXMQo9CKFGqiYYQjoe83Wl3Q971u7A\n6U0D7NUaLTqqFPxbKH81KjjAdM2G8ZfUc073+JtLGhkdPd3GR1/nrc/pqV191qRj\nNqX3GyY1gZDFXqWFqG1oEf9NYVMWa+pZNIip7grw/RGOsBewZGEFEf7s+NNWfiCi\n0LQE9eiqdfKZKUV9+mSbFvPdz5qVwdE2taZWRVA73ep7Tfg21ppABKt5JGzZJrjR\nqL4AoRFedKE1a7+m+tXqv4xpNYXYAbDu0iyTaC7EdmAN4t+3bP4oRtjsG2cB+0K0\n46Fq/BklVl2KlHxsHmcZ7eAR3mMbjTounhUnhlA3NE4/BDqFumnk0+EPUKP8+/vg\n/OoGrGuaECP5A6M0a4T6AFENZ6WfgWOpsOD7D8QikTgnclu0PlzTBGGceX3AqzUV\nUiOKztIWCi4eBWZNP2D7\n=1u73\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-13T07:24:48Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id"