n* fix bulk shutdown test assertion\n\n* Revert \"add actual analysis-icu-less docker containers in CI to lock it down\"\n\nThis reverts commit dfa9aacb08235047414096084543ffca980c7e65.\n\n* simplify analysis-icu startup guidance\n\n* fix OpenSearch bulk flusher shutdown\n\n* linting fix\n\n* query nodes directly for plugins instead of trying and catching err\n\n* remove unneeded comments","tree":{"sha":"5831fb4dc10e8f9a342ab0ae7a7dd70dc7427fa4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unity-Billal-mesloub/mattermost/git/trees/5831fb4dc10e8f9a342ab0ae7a7dd70dc7427fa4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unity-Billal-mesloub/mattermost/git/commits/929a2e9e3f908c09b0582cea75433b2a482bc019","verification":{"payload":"tree 5831fb4dc10e8f9a342ab0ae7a7dd70dc7427fa4\nparent 81d6d1ea20c07d9394cb569e7dd4da546cfc56fe\nauthor Christopher Poile <cpoile@gmail.com> 1786545624 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786545624 -0400\n\n[MM-70106] Prevent search startup bulk processor leaks (#37873)\n\n* the main fix + unit tests\n\n* add actual analysis-icu-less docker containers in CI to lock it down\n\n* fix AppError test assertions\n\n* fix CI search startup tests\n\n* fix bulk processor flusher shutdown\n\n* fix bulk shutdown test assertion\n\n* Revert \"add actual analysis-icu-less docker containers in CI to lock it down\"\n\nThis reverts commit dfa9aacb08235047414096084543ffca980c7e65.\n\n* simplify analysis-icu startup guidance\n\n* fix OpenSearch bulk flusher shutdown\n\n* linting fix\n\n* query nodes directly for plugins instead of trying and catching err\n\n* remove unneeded comments","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfIXYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA0r4QAJizQZUHNT23BX+bkaLGlQIo\nRU75ktESsgueo7ydDEn6m6tY2mVT4aFGO2VGTq09a3IfV6UZRWr4xfuv9vGIOL1g\nLZgfua1V6Em5mXasWTkzrVYwmbmpx2K+Vyir2QtHDbB+lR5bCsMf/kWKw0X1o2sx\nEj+lwjaTY+si+N7AUJrUPzmnDZOB2cAgW0Hda1tb/uTu830NLaiG2IaSBAeaDbjk\ngd0ph+4JkNBItxBzPu1fRUg00wi1Mg7rilH78dFOczc+/N83xTT4rw2AnpItuLML\