_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Unity-Billal-mesloub/mattermost/commit/8ce3c54a5ed76b2aa39a46cf8a1b517ea53ec0cc","node_id":"C_kwDORDiVY9oAKDhjZTNjNTRhNWVkNzZiMmFhMzlhNDZjZjhhMWI1MTdlYTUzZWMwY2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Unity-Billal-mesloub/mattermost/commit/4901a7fc2a9f075e2fef972498cfa5e4a74c1e9f","sha":"4901a7fc2a9f075e2fef972498cfa5e4a74c1e9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unity-Billal-mesloub/mattermost/commits/4901a7fc2a9f075e2fef972498cfa5e4a74c1e9f"}],"sha":"8ce3c54a5ed76b2aa39a46cf8a1b517ea53ec0cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unity-Billal-mesloub/mattermost/commits/8ce3c54a5ed76b2aa39a46cf8a1b517ea53ec0cc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1210556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/cursor","id":206951365,"login":"cursor[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDODFXTxQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unity-Billal-mesloub/mattermost/commits/4901a7fc2a9f075e2fef972498cfa5e4a74c1e9f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T20:24:14Z","email":"206951365+cursor[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"cursor[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T20:24:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[MM-70186] Add tooltips to platform icons in session attribute picker (#37898)\n\n* [MM-70186] Add tooltips to platform icons in session attribute picker\n\nWrap the browser/desktop/mobile platform icons rendered as trailing\nelements in the session attribute selector menu with WithTooltip so\nhovering reveals the client context each icon represents.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* [MM-70186] Add tests for platform icon tooltips in attribute picker\n\nCover the accessible label mapping for each platform icon and assert the\nDesktop/Mobile/Web Browser tooltips open on hover in the session\nattribute selector menu.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* [MM-70186] Cover unknown-platform guard and simplify hover target\n\nAdd a case ensuring platforms without a matching icon are dropped while\nknown platforms still render, and target the icon''s parent span directly\nfor the hover assertions.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* Add tooltips to platform icons in main Session Attributes table\n\n- Wrap each platform icon in WithTooltip\n- Update browser label from ''Browser'' to ''Web Browser'' for consistency with attribute selector\n- Add hover tests to verify tooltip behavior\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin Binnie <devinbinnie@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix import order lint issue in platform_icons.test.tsx\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin Binnie <devinbinnie@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Refactor platform icons to use shared component and fix tooltip rendering\n\n- Fix tooltip issue in session attributes table by wrapping icon in span\n- Make PlatformIcons component flexible with variant prop (all-slots vs active-only)\n- Export PLATFORM_ICONS and platformLabels for reuse\n- Update attribute selector to use shared PlatformIcons component\n- Remove duplicate icon definitions and i18n keys from attribute selector\n- This eliminates code duplication and ensures consistent tooltip behavior\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin Binnie <devinbinnie@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix lint and type errors from shared PlatformIcons refactor\n\nThe shared-component refactor left attribute_selector_menu.tsx referencing\nWithTooltip without an import (a runtime ReferenceError for synced/disallowed\nattributes), kept now-unused ComponentType/defineMessages imports, and passed a\nstring[] to PlatformIcons which expects SessionPlatform[]. Restore the tooltip\nimport, drop the unused imports, and narrow platforms via getSessionAttrs.\nAlso apply eslint autofixes to platform_icons.tsx.\n\n* Fix platform icon spacing by moving WithTooltip outside styled wrapper\n\n- Move WithTooltip to wrap the outer span instead of adding inner wrapper\n- This preserves the original CSS structure for both table and menu\n- Fixes: table background now square with proper padding\n- Fixes: menu icons maintain original spacing\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin Binnie <devinbinnie@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix dropdown menu icon spacing by rendering icons individually\n\n- Replace PlatformIcons component usage in menu with individual icon rendering\n- Each icon is now a separate element in trailingElements array\n- Maintains proper spacing between icons in the dropdown menu\n- Preserves shared PLATFORM_ICONS and platformLabels from platform_icons module\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin Binnie <devinbinnie@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Remove irrelevant package-lock.json changes\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin Binnie <devinbinnie@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Revert browser label from ''Web Browser'' back to ''Browser''\n\n- Keep the existing ''Browser'' verbiage in i18n and all references\n- Update platformLabels default message to ''Browser''\n- Update all test assertions to expect ''Browser'' instead of ''Web Browser''\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin Binnie <devinbinnie@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\nCo-authored-by: Devin Binnie <devinbinnie@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"0a8c5444781d0f0b48f4345ed060259a0773f96e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unity-Billal-mesloub/mattermost/git/trees/0a8c5444781d0f0b48f4345ed060259a0773f96e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unity-Billal-mesloub/mattermost/git/commits/4901a7fc2a9f075e2fef972498cfa5e4a74c1e9f","verification":{"payload":"tree 0a8c5444781d0f0b48f4345ed060259a0773f96e\nparent a6d008c5c2b13a6845a39bab0eaae13aacc1859d\nauthor cursor[bot] <206951365+cursor[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1786393454 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786393454 +0000\n\n[MM-70186] Add tooltips to platform icons in session attribute picker (#37898)\n\n* [MM-70186] Add tooltips to platform icons in session attribute picker\n\nWrap the browser/desktop/mobile platform icons rendered as trailing\nelements in the session attribute selector menu with WithTooltip so\nhovering reveals the client context each icon represents.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* [MM-70186] Add tests for platform icon tooltips in attribute picker\n\nCover the accessible label mapping for each platform icon and assert the\nDesktop/Mobile/Web Browser tooltips open on hover in the session\nattribute selector menu.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* [MM-70186] Cover unknown-platform guard and simplify hover target\n\nAdd a case ensuring platforms without a matching icon are dropped while\nknown platforms still render, and target the icon''s parent span directly\nfor the hover assertions.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* Add tooltips to platform icons in main Session Attributes table\n\n- Wrap each platform icon in WithTooltip\n- Update browser label from ''Browser'' to ''Web Browser'' for consistency with attribute selector\n- Add hover tests to verify tooltip behavior\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin Binnie <devinbinnie@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix import order lint issue in platform_icons.test.tsx\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin Binnie <devinbinnie@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Refactor platform icons to use shared component and fix tooltip rendering\n\n- Fix tooltip issue in session attributes table by wrapping icon in span\n- Make PlatformIcons component flexible with variant prop (all-slots vs active-only)\n- Export PLATFORM_ICONS and platformLabels for reuse\n- Update attribute selector to use shared PlatformIcons component\n- Remove duplicate icon definitions and i18n keys from attribute selector\n- This eliminates code duplication and ensures consistent tooltip behavior\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin Binnie <devinbinnie@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix lint and type errors from shared PlatformIcons refactor\n\nThe shared-component refactor left attribute_selector_menu.tsx referencing\nWithTooltip without an import (a runtime ReferenceError for synced/disallowed\nattributes), kept now-unused ComponentType/defineMessages imports, and passed a\nstring[] to PlatformIcons which expects SessionPlatform[]. Restore the tooltip\nimport, drop the unused imports, and narrow platforms via getSessionAttrs.\nAlso apply eslint autofixes to platform_icons.tsx.\n\n* Fix platform icon spacing by moving WithTooltip outside styled wrapper\n\n- Move WithTooltip to wrap the outer span instead of adding inner wrapper\n- This preserves the original CSS structure for both table and menu\n- Fixes: table background now square with proper padding\n- Fixes: menu icons maintain original spacing\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin Binnie <devinbinnie@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix dropdown menu icon spacing by rendering icons individually\n\n- Replace PlatformIcons component usage in menu with individual icon rendering\n- Each icon is now a separate element in trailingElements array\n- Maintains proper spacing between icons in the dropdown menu\n- Preserves shared PLATFORM_ICONS and platformLabels from platform_icons module\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin Binnie <devinbinnie@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Remove irrelevant package-lock.json changes\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin Binnie <devinbinnie@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Revert browser label from ''Web Browser'' back to ''Browser''\n\n- Keep the existing ''Browser'' verbiage in i18n and all references\n- Update platformLabels default message to ''Browser''\n- Update all test assertions to expect ''Browser'' instead of ''Web Browser''\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin Binnie <devinbinnie@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\nCo-authored-by: Devin Binnie <devinbinnie@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqejNuCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAavQQAG4v2X4lV6uc/NuVAGiqYHwJ\nktK2NIXzwAStuXTRuQzqXVg1/pnQGQgFH9qacuzu6wx6P2AcpxtUNtk0mGaAG4A6\npJLHLR2427WrTW9H/Xcg8Z84ED1xgWbK2fSAjaeHcCMmU1JUabDqDUcH6lnMVsoN\nyjXF9jESh3VNzMHHed0ek2i8iLOPDbG43hMyDE48Dlgctl4NfLCy0f5GFHYEMhvR\nMg505FXF3zgn4qzDz4CXYm4NJSfpbLm9LRXRlUolBlY1G7qzPrwVp52iUd2oaU2f\n6FHHZVKdtDH+QRszcXVizxb4psO7/dmk0cz+0MbIdmGx0wprF/YYAPA/9OhGXDcl\np0mxa7PU1AXlnxXj0eEIf7liHyUkwnBg/6vEv66o+9P0afMu85VrMXT+dSXN/pQy\nOCLimTiBE9gcm6RIMcD0/keJXEYF/mmn3PlokqL37JIy0UtpcNu6OHmufhN1P714\nMt83KvIhvtXOGTcXS1y8h2A70T7KOyp6nc2wDa29Ql5H91PTqFG78Xb1DpJ2nsYB\nsf1OeHxg1BRhI1A9TqOMnJNGzY7NvBEHdGYB2lGI34dDG3Ik1GF07k/dYs5PADql\nZLGbKAFJNJbR9gSDvdLgIQzkuh3oobOVJq0L045MwHWQVwb6J1LhkIby19QyRcFI\nSmaLtCpGIdOwRaIpQHiN\n=ROIG\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE----