://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unity-Billal-mesloub/mattermost/commits/60c44fc48ae87042085beec3ffa5bbac3cc9e1bc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T17:31:58Z","email":"206951365+cursor[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"cursor[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T17:31:58Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[MM-70153] Fix error when deleting the only remaining channel permission rule (#37899)\n\n* [MM-70153] Fix error deleting the only remaining channel permission rule\n\nDeleting the last permission rule in a channel''s Permissions Policy tab\nleft the channel policy with no rules and no imports, which the server\nrejects with \"Unable to save access control policy.\" Mirror the\nMembership Policy tab and delete the channel policy instead when the\nresulting policy would be empty, returning the channel to standard access.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* [MM-70153] Add tests for removing the last channel permission rule\n\nCovers deleting the empty channel policy on save, preserving a remaining\nmembership rule, and surfacing a non-404 delete failure.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* [MM-70153] Cover 404-as-success and imports-present branches\n\nAdd tests confirming a 404 delete is treated as success and that a policy\nwith remaining imports is saved rather than deleted when the last\npermission rule is removed.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* [MM-70153] Reset originalActive after empty channel policy delete\n\nAfter deleting an emptied channel policy, clear the stale active flag so\na subsequent save in the same tab session does not re-enable membership\nauto-sync. Mirrors the Membership Policy tab empty-delete path.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>","tree":{"sha":"2a671604020684076006243916bbad4e67de1e41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unity-Billal-mesloub/mattermost/git/trees/2a671604020684076006243916bbad4e67de1e41"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unity-Billal-mesloub/mattermost/git/commits/60c44fc48ae87042085beec3ffa5bbac3cc9e1bc","verification":{"payload":"tree 2a671604020684076006243916bbad4e67de1e41\nparent 7e7ec9a61cda622d12ca63e4469742b892f4b8d2\nauthor cursor[bot] <206951365+cursor[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1786383118 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786383118 +0000\n\n[MM-70153] Fix error when deleting the only remaining channel permission rule (#37899)\n\n* [MM-70153] Fix error deleting the only remaining channel permission rule\n\nDeleting the last permission rule in a channel''s Permissions Policy tab\nleft the channel policy with no rules and no imports, which the server\nrejects with \"Unable to save access control policy.\" Mirror the\nMembership Policy tab and delete the channel policy instead when the\nresulting policy would be empty, returning the channel to standard access.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* [MM-70153] Add tests for removing the last channel permission rule\n\nCovers deleting the empty channel policy on save, preserving a remaining\nmembership rule, and surfacing a non-404 delete failure.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* [MM-70153] Cover 404-as-success and imports-present branches\n\nAdd tests confirming a 404 delete is treated as success and that a policy\nwith remaining imports is saved rather than deleted when the last\npermission rule is removed.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* [MM-70153] Reset originalActive after empty channel policy delete\n\nAfter deleting an emptied channel policy, clear the stale active flag so\na subsequent save in the same tab session does not re-enable membership\nauto-sync. Mirrors the Membership Policy tab empty-delete path.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqegsOCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAggIQAAqxqIks6dvxpuS6TWPi+puc\nI9lsUXrVRo/88XLY9XtaDjPGRsNTrXquu+TwgELwZpFtulV1upwPMxMao/OldM0P\nlPFnhGhl0XwEahuzk//0CvFS5evV++djX/E1TCRx12HO+xKpthdy4HnSwMmdDjEf\nyXuvj9xJOyOalxMwFiEQvHoBwkTe8ANEtXWJNx8bON9TJuWsmhhMWiMi0Eup4Y3r\nkJV2AlirvFOcPstv0Stda7SLhbbyowIS83V5Vh5AsBKFdEGiurh+9pwz0Wvvnqi7\nYfroWiZ+/TkzDdTT825d5NluO+rbp1tWV/zvRbxmvtlcqOZEHw40Dx5QlQtwwHPw\nPBllVcPAMeUj1UlptSNbiqKQMeP3rGGY+thW36dn2qbOGinr1OrUe4j7/LU1tMFS\nE9kqOkaD4NEphCnma/Cs6c+WQNQqJrN+g8u8+iV2VwPlaR/0Q7ZELcDfBTPz0c01\ny3DWcu9Nxuu1mghwpF9ObHpaPGPY7Vr+oVr0CAGZkRYMJKiDHoyY75iMESBJPdVZ\nHr2rOfHZTbcXO97iPZyJO0x+7l3SbmWtAp4mgq6GgvarvZOC/rGQHnAJyhxZAOQb\nzLtJXTxjBhU2oOCQIz9TbaqRFieTjYULRm6ZoH4ZU0wcSKKHE5CStpzS3G4na4dD\n0lkiFZ/10r5bI7h1KEBH\n=sqxW\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-10T17:32:02Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"