m/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unity-Billal-mesloub/mattermost/commits/7e7ec9a61cda622d12ca63e4469742b892f4b8d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T17:18:30Z","email":"206951365+cursor[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"cursor[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T17:18:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[MM-70142] Fix unreachable buttons in the Simulate access session-attribute popover (#37900)\n\n* [MM-70142] Fix simulate access editor popover overflow\n\nCap the session-attribute editor form to the viewport height and make\nthe field grid scroll so the Apply/Cancel actions stay reachable when\nmany environmental attributes are configured.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* [MM-70142] Cap simulate access popover to available viewport height\n\nUse Floating UI''s size middleware to constrain the session-attribute\neditor popover to the space available on its chosen side, and make the\npanel a flex column whose field grid scrolls, so the Apply/Cancel\nactions stay reachable regardless of anchor position or attribute count.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>","tree":{"sha":"edafc56518c69043a69c9b50b0e44b1bb19c953f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unity-Billal-mesloub/mattermost/git/trees/edafc56518c69043a69c9b50b0e44b1bb19c953f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unity-Billal-mesloub/mattermost/git/commits/7e7ec9a61cda622d12ca63e4469742b892f4b8d2","verification":{"payload":"tree edafc56518c69043a69c9b50b0e44b1bb19c953f\nparent 144e1b46a0adaffac2fc13a9677a26eb57900462\nauthor curs